{"id": "yidan", "title": "一旦…就…, 因而 and 从而: once, so, and so", "cat": "Conditions, reasons and topics", "catOrder": 12, "catBlurb": "If, as long as, only if, except, in order to, and \"about\": set conditions and link ideas.", "covers": [1, 2], "formula": [{"t": "一旦", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Condition", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "就", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Result", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["一旦 … 就 … means 'once, if it ever happens': as soon as the condition is true, the result follows. It is used for something that is not certain but, if it happens, matters a lot: 一旦下雨，比赛就会停 'Once it rains, the match will stop'. It often points to a worry or a rule, and it sounds more serious than 要是.", "因而 'so, for that reason' and 从而 'and so, thereby' join a result to what came before, mostly in writing. 因而 gives the result of a reason: 他经常运动，因而身体很好 'He often exercises, so his health is good'. 从而 adds a second step that follows from the first action, often a good result: 多读书可以提高水平，从而找到更好的工作 'Reading more can raise one's level, and so help one find a better job'."], "examples": [{"zh": "一旦下雨，比赛就会停。", "py": "Yídàn xiàyǔ, bǐsài jiù huì tíng.", "en": "Once it rains, the match will stop."}, {"zh": "你一旦开始，就不能放弃。", "py": "Nǐ yídàn kāishǐ, jiù bù néng fàngqì.", "en": "Once you start, you cannot give up."}, {"zh": "他经常运动，因而身体很好。", "py": "Tā jīngcháng yùndòng, yīn'ér shēntǐ hěn hǎo.", "en": "He often exercises, so his health is good."}, {"zh": "多读书可以提高水平，从而找到更好的工作。", "py": "Duō dúshū kěyǐ tígāo shuǐpíng, cóng'ér zhǎo dào gèng hǎo de gōngzuò.", "en": "Reading more can raise one's level, and so help one find a better job."}], "mistakes": ["一旦 suggests that the condition is serious or unlikely. For an everyday 'if', use 如果 or 要是: 如果你有空，就来看我。", "从而 needs a first action before it. Do not use it after 因为: 因为他很忙，从而没来 is wrong; say 因为他很忙，所以没来 or 他很忙，因而没来."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "你一旦开始，就不能放弃。", "py": "Nǐ yídàn kāishǐ, jiù bù néng fàngqì.", "en": "Once you start, you cannot give up."}, "explain": "一旦 + condition + 就 + result.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Once you start, you cannot give up.", "toks": ["你", "一旦", "开始", "就", "不", "能", "放弃"], "reveal": "你一旦开始，就不能放弃。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他经常运动，因而身体很好。", "py": "Tā jīngcháng yùndòng, yīn'ér shēntǐ hěn hǎo.", "en": "He often exercises, so his health is good."}, "explain": "因而 introduces the result.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He often exercises, so his health is good.", "toks": ["他", "经常", "运动", "因而", "身体", "很", "好"], "reveal": "他经常运动，因而身体很好。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "一旦发现问题，我们就告诉你。", "py": "Yídàn fāxiàn wèntí, wǒmen jiù gàosu nǐ.", "en": "Once we find a problem, we will tell you."}, "explain": "一旦 starts the condition.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "___发现问题，我们就告诉你。", "sub": "Once we find a problem, we will tell you.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["yidan", "一旦"], "reveal": "一旦 · yídàn"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他昨天很忙，因而没来。", "py": "Tā zuótiān hěn máng, yīn'ér méi lái.", "en": "He was busy yesterday, so he did not come."}, "explain": "从而 cannot follow 因为; 因而 gives the result.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He was busy yesterday, so he did not come?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他昨天很忙，因而没来。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "因为他昨天很忙，从而没来。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他昨天很忙，因而没来。", "levelOnly": ["因为他昨天很忙，从而没来。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "因为他昨天很忙，没有来。", "py": "Yīnwèi tā zuótiān hěn máng, méiyǒu lái.", "en": "Because he was busy yesterday, he did not come."}, "explain": "After 因为, do not use 从而.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["因为", "他", "昨天", "很", "忙", "从而", "没有", "来"], "punct": "。", "spot": 5, "reveal": "因为他昨天很忙，没有来。", "levelOnly": ["因为他昨天很忙，从而没有来。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "huoshi", "title": "或是…或是…, …也好…也好 and 加上: either, whether, plus", "cat": "Joining people and ideas", "catOrder": 11, "catBlurb": "With, together, also, then, because and although, first and then, and at the same time: link people, actions and sentences.", "covers": [3, 4, 5], "formula": [{"t": "或是", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": ""}, {"t": "A", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "或是", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "B", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["或是 … 或是 … means 'either … or …', listing choices that all work: 周末我或是看书，或是看电影 'At the weekend I either read or watch films'. The first 或是 can be dropped: 你可以喝茶或是咖啡 'You can have tea or coffee'. 或是 is the same as 或者, a little more written. It is for statements; in a question use 还是.", "… 也好，… 也好 means 'whether … or …': the result is the same whichever one you pick. Put 也好 after each choice and use 都 in the result: 买也好，不买也好，我都没意见 'Whether to buy or not, I have no opinion'.", "加上 'on top of that, plus' adds one more reason: 天气不好，加上时间太晚，我们就不去了 'The weather is bad and, on top of that, it is too late, so we are not going'. 以及 'and, as well as' joins things of the same kind, often the last two in a list: 苹果、香蕉以及西瓜 'apples, bananas and watermelons'."], "examples": [{"zh": "周末我或是看书，或是看电影。", "py": "Zhōumò wǒ huòshì kàn shū, huòshì kàn diànyǐng.", "en": "At the weekend I either read or watch films."}, {"zh": "买也好，不买也好，我都没意见。", "py": "Mǎi yě hǎo, bù mǎi yě hǎo, wǒ dōu méi yìjiàn.", "en": "Whether to buy or not, I have no opinion."}, {"zh": "天气不好，加上时间太晚，我们就不去了。", "py": "Tiānqì bù hǎo, jiāshàng shíjiān tài wǎn, wǒmen jiù bú qù le.", "en": "The weather is bad and, on top of that, it is too late, so we are not going."}, {"zh": "桌子上有苹果、香蕉以及西瓜。", "py": "Zhuōzi shàng yǒu píngguǒ, xiāngjiāo yǐjí xīguā.", "en": "There are apples, bananas and watermelons on the table."}], "mistakes": ["Use 或是 in statements and 还是 in questions: 你喝茶还是咖啡？ is right; 你喝茶或是咖啡？ is wrong.", "也好 needs a result that is the same either way, so put 都 in the result: 去也好，不去也好，我都没意见."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "周末我或是看书，或是看电影。", "py": "Zhōumò wǒ huòshì kàn shū, huòshì kàn diànyǐng.", "en": "At the weekend I either read or watch films."}, "explain": "或是 A，或是 B.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: At the weekend I either read or watch films.", "toks": ["周末", "我", "或是", "看", "书", "或是", "看", "电影"], "reveal": "周末我或是看书，或是看电影。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "买也好，不买也好，我都没意见。", "py": "Mǎi yě hǎo, bù mǎi yě hǎo, wǒ dōu méi yìjiàn.", "en": "Whether to buy or not, I have no opinion."}, "explain": "After …也好，…也好, the result takes 都.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "买也好，不买也好，我___没意见。", "sub": "Whether to buy or not, I have no opinion.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["dou", "都"], "reveal": "都 · dōu"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "天气不好，加上时间太晚，我们没去。", "py": "Tiānqì bù hǎo, jiāshàng shíjiān tài wǎn, wǒmen méi qù.", "en": "The weather was bad and, on top of that, it was too late, so we did not go."}, "explain": "加上 adds one more reason.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "天气不好，___时间太晚，我们没去。", "sub": "The weather was bad and, on top of that, it was too late, so we did not go.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["jiashang", "加上"], "reveal": "加上 · jiāshàng"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我喜欢苹果、香蕉以及西瓜。", "py": "Wǒ xǐhuan píngguǒ, xiāngjiāo yǐjí xīguā.", "en": "I like apples, bananas and watermelons."}, "explain": "以及 means 'and'; 还是 asks a question.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: I like apples, bananas and watermelons?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "我喜欢苹果、香蕉以及西瓜。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "我喜欢苹果、香蕉还是西瓜。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "我喜欢苹果、香蕉以及西瓜。", "levelOnly": ["我喜欢苹果、香蕉还是西瓜。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "你喝茶还是咖啡？", "py": "Nǐ hē chá háishi kāfēi?", "en": "Do you drink tea or coffee?"}, "explain": "In a question use 还是 alone.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["你", "喝", "茶", "或是", "还是", "咖啡"], "punct": "？", "spot": 3, "reveal": "你喝茶还是咖啡？", "levelOnly": ["你喝茶或是还是咖啡？"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "zaiye", "title": "再…也… and 没有…就没有…: however, without", "cat": "Conditions, reasons and topics", "catOrder": 12, "catBlurb": "If, as long as, only if, except, in order to, and \"about\": set conditions and link ideas.", "covers": [6, 7], "formula": [{"t": "再", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Adjective / Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "也", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Result", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["再 … 也 … means 'however …, still …': whatever the degree, the result does not change. 再 goes before an adjective or a verb and 也 before the result: 再累，我也要完成工作 'However tired I am, I still need to finish the work'; 这个东西再贵，他也想买 'However expensive this thing is, he still wants to buy it'. Here 再 does not mean 'again'.", "没有 … 就没有 … means 'without …, there is no …': the first thing is the base of the second. 没有水，就没有生命 'Without water, there is no life'; 没有你的帮助，就没有我的今天 'Without your help, there would be no me today'."], "examples": [{"zh": "再累，我也要完成工作。", "py": "Zài lèi, wǒ yě yào wánchéng gōngzuò.", "en": "However tired I am, I still need to finish the work."}, {"zh": "这个东西再贵，他也想买。", "py": "Zhège dōngxi zài guì, tā yě xiǎng mǎi.", "en": "However expensive this thing is, he still wants to buy it."}, {"zh": "没有水，就没有生命。", "py": "Méiyǒu shuǐ, jiù méiyǒu shēngmìng.", "en": "Without water, there is no life."}, {"zh": "没有你的帮助，就没有我的今天。", "py": "Méiyǒu nǐ de bāngzhù, jiù méiyǒu wǒ de jīntiān.", "en": "Without your help, there would be no me today."}], "mistakes": ["Keep 也 in the result. 再累，我要完成工作 loses the meaning 'however'; say 再累，我也要完成工作.", "再 already means 'however', so do not add 很 after it: 再冷 is right, 再很冷 is wrong."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "再累，我也要完成工作。", "py": "Zài lèi, wǒ yě yào wánchéng gōngzuò.", "en": "However tired I am, I still need to finish the work."}, "explain": "再 + adjective, 也 + result.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: However tired I am, I still need to finish the work.", "toks": ["再", "累", "我", "也", "要", "完成", "工作"], "reveal": "再累，我也要完成工作。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "没有水，就没有生命。", "py": "Méiyǒu shuǐ, jiù méiyǒu shēngmìng.", "en": "Without water, there is no life."}, "explain": "没有 … 就没有 ….", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Without water, there is no life.", "toks": ["没有", "水", "就", "没有", "生命"], "reveal": "没有水，就没有生命。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "路再远，我们也要走。", "py": "Lù zài yuǎn, wǒmen yě yào zǒu.", "en": "However far the road is, we still have to walk."}, "explain": "再 means 'however' here.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "路___远，我们也要走。", "sub": "However far the road is, we still have to walk.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["zai", "再"], "reveal": "再 · zài"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这个东西再贵，他也想买。", "py": "Zhège dōngxi zài guì, tā yě xiǎng mǎi.", "en": "However expensive this thing is, he still wants to buy it."}, "explain": "也 goes before the verb.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: However expensive this thing is, he still wants to buy it?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "这个东西再贵，他也想买。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "这个东西再贵，他想买也。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "这个东西再贵，他也想买。", "levelOnly": ["这个东西再贵，他想买也。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "再冷，我们也要去。", "py": "Zài lěng, wǒmen yě yào qù.", "en": "However cold it is, we still have to go."}, "explain": "再 already means 'however'; do not add 很.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["再", "很", "冷", "我们", "也", "要", "去"], "punct": "。", "spot": 1, "reveal": "再冷，我们也要去。", "levelOnly": ["再很冷，我们也要去。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "weideshi", "title": "为的是, 以便 and 以…为…: in order to, take … as …", "cat": "Conditions, reasons and topics", "catOrder": 12, "catBlurb": "If, as long as, only if, except, in order to, and \"about\": set conditions and link ideas.", "covers": [8, 9], "formula": [{"t": "Action", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "为的是 / 以便", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Purpose", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["为的是 + purpose says why someone does something that you have just mentioned: 他每天跑步，为的是身体健康 'He runs every day in order to be healthy'. The action comes first, the purpose second. 以便 'so that' also puts the purpose second but is more formal and the purpose becomes possible because of the action: 请留下电话号码，以便我们找你 'Please leave your phone number so that we can find you'.", "以 … 为 … means 'take … as …'. 以 … 为中心 is 'with … as the centre': 以学校为中心，附近有很多商店 'With the school as the centre, there are many shops nearby'. 以 … 为目标 is 'with … as the goal': 他以考上大学为目标，每天都很努力 'He takes getting into university as his goal and works hard every day'. 为 is read wéi here."], "examples": [{"zh": "他每天跑步，为的是身体健康。", "py": "Tā měitiān pǎobù, wèi de shì shēntǐ jiànkāng.", "en": "He runs every day in order to be healthy."}, {"zh": "请留下电话号码，以便我们联系你。", "py": "Qǐng liúxia diànhuà hàomǎ, yǐ biàn wǒmen liánxì nǐ.", "en": "Please leave your phone number so that we will contact you."}, {"zh": "以学校为中心，附近有很多商店。", "py": "Yǐ xuéxiào wèi zhōngxīn, fùjìn yǒu hěn duō shāngdiàn.", "en": "With the school as the centre, there are many shops nearby."}, {"zh": "他以考上大学为目标，每天都很努力。", "py": "Tā yǐ kǎo shàng dàxué wèi mùbiāo, měitiān dōu hěn nǔlì.", "en": "He takes getting into university as his goal and works hard every day."}], "mistakes": ["为的是 comes after the action. 为的是身体健康，他每天跑步 is back to front in this pattern; say 他每天跑步，为的是身体健康.", "为的是 already means 'in order to', so do not add 为了 after it. In 以 … 为 …, 为 is read wéi: say 以学校为中心, not 以学校是中心."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "他每天跑步，为的是身体健康。", "py": "Tā měitiān pǎobù, wèi de shì shēntǐ jiànkāng.", "en": "He runs every day in order to be healthy."}, "explain": "Action first, then 为的是 + purpose.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He runs every day in order to be healthy.", "toks": ["他", "每天", "跑步", "为", "的", "是", "身体", "健康"], "reveal": "他每天跑步，为的是身体健康。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "请留下电话号码，以便我们联系你。", "py": "Qǐng liúxia diànhuà hàomǎ, yǐ biàn wǒmen liánxì nǐ.", "en": "Please leave your phone number so that we will contact you."}, "explain": "以便 introduces the purpose.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Please leave your phone number so that we will contact you.", "toks": ["请", "留下", "电话", "号码", "以", "便", "我们", "联系", "你"], "reveal": "请留下电话号码，以便我们联系你。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "以学校为中心，附近有很多商店。", "py": "Yǐ xuéxiào wèi zhōngxīn, fùjìn yǒu hěn duō shāngdiàn.", "en": "With the school as the centre, there are many shops nearby."}, "explain": "以 … 为中心 = with … as the centre.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "___学校为中心，附近有很多商店。", "sub": "With the school as the centre, there are many shops nearby.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["yi", "以"], "reveal": "以 · yǐ"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他以考上大学为目标。", "py": "Tā yǐ kǎo shàng dàxué wèi mùbiāo.", "en": "He takes getting into university as his goal."}, "explain": "以 + thing + 为目标.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He takes getting into university as his goal?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他以考上大学为目标。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他为目标以考上大学。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他以考上大学为目标。", "levelOnly": ["他为目标以考上大学。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他学汉语，为的是去中国工作。", "py": "Tā xué Hànyǔ, wèi de shì qù Zhōngguó gōngzuò.", "en": "He studies Chinese in order to work in China."}, "explain": "为的是 already means 'in order to'.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "学", "汉语", "为", "的", "是", "为了", "去", "中国", "工作"], "punct": "。", "spot": 6, "reveal": "他学汉语，为的是去中国工作。", "levelOnly": ["他学汉语，为的是为了去中国工作。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "fanerr", "title": "反而, 不然 / 要不 and 毕竟: on the contrary, otherwise, after all", "cat": "Opinions, advice and guesses", "catOrder": 13, "catBlurb": "Say what you think, give advice, say what must be done, and say how sure you are.", "covers": [10, 11, 12], "formula": [{"t": "Expected result", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "反而", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Opposite result", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["反而 'on the contrary, instead' shows a result that is the opposite of what you would expect: 雨不但没停，反而更大了 'The rain did not stop; on the contrary, it got heavier'. It goes before the verb or adjective in the second half and often follows 不但没 / 没有.", "不然 and 要不 'otherwise, or else' warn what will happen if the first thing is not done: 快一点，不然我们会迟到 'Be quick, or we will be late'. 要不 also suggests another idea: 要不我们明天再去吧？ 'Or shall we go again tomorrow?'. 否则 (HSK 4) does the same job and sounds more formal.", "毕竟 'after all' reminds the listener of a basic fact that explains or excuses something: 他毕竟还是个孩子，别生气 'He is only a child after all; do not be angry'. It goes before the verb or the noun phrase."], "examples": [{"zh": "雨不但没停，反而更大了。", "py": "Yǔ búdàn méi tíng, fǎn'ér gèng dà le.", "en": "The rain did not stop; on the contrary, it got heavier."}, {"zh": "快一点，不然我们会迟到。", "py": "Kuài yì diǎn, bùrán wǒmen huì chídào.", "en": "Be quick, or we will be late."}, {"zh": "要不我们明天再去吧？", "py": "Yàobù wǒmen míngtiān zài qù ba?", "en": "Or shall we go again tomorrow?"}, {"zh": "他毕竟还是个孩子，别生气。", "py": "Tā bìjìng háishi ge háizi, bié shēngqì.", "en": "He is only a child after all; do not be angry."}], "mistakes": ["Use 反而 only when the result goes against what you expect. 吃了药，他反而好了 is odd; say 吃了药，他反而更不舒服了.", "不然 comes after the thing you should do and before the bad result: 快一点，不然会迟到. Do not put the warning first."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "雨不但没停，反而更大了。", "py": "Yǔ búdàn méi tíng, fǎn'ér gèng dà le.", "en": "The rain did not stop; on the contrary, it got heavier."}, "explain": "不但没 … 反而 ….", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: The rain did not stop; on the contrary, it got heavier.", "toks": ["雨", "不但", "没", "停", "反而", "更", "大", "了"], "reveal": "雨不但没停，反而更大了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "快一点，不然我们会迟到。", "py": "Kuài yì diǎn, bùrán wǒmen huì chídào.", "en": "Be quick, or we will be late."}, "explain": "不然 + the bad result.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Be quick, or we will be late.", "toks": ["快", "一", "点", "不然", "我们", "会", "迟到"], "reveal": "快一点，不然我们会迟到。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他毕竟还是个孩子。", "py": "Tā bìjìng háishi ge háizi.", "en": "He is only a child after all."}, "explain": "毕竟 = after all.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "他___还是个孩子。", "sub": "He is only a child after all.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["bijing", "毕竟"], "reveal": "毕竟 · bìjìng"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "快一点，不然我们会迟到。", "py": "Kuài yì diǎn, bùrán wǒmen huì chídào.", "en": "Be quick, or we will be late."}, "explain": "Say what to do first, then 不然 + the bad result.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: Be quick, or we will be late?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "快一点，不然我们会迟到。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "不然我们会迟到，快一点。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "快一点，不然我们会迟到。", "levelOnly": ["不然我们会迟到，快一点。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "雨不但没停，反而更大了。", "py": "Yǔ búdàn méi tíng, fǎn'ér gèng dà le.", "en": "The rain did not stop; on the contrary, it got heavier."}, "explain": "反而 already means 'on the contrary'; do not add 却.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["雨", "不但", "没", "停", "反而", "却", "更", "大", "了"], "punct": "。", "spot": 5, "reveal": "雨不但没停，反而更大了。", "levelOnly": ["雨不但没停，反而却更大了。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "guoran", "title": "果然, 居然 and 似乎: as expected, unexpectedly, it seems", "cat": "Opinions, advice and guesses", "catOrder": 13, "catBlurb": "Say what you think, give advice, say what must be done, and say how sure you are.", "covers": [13, 14, 15], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "果然 / 居然", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["果然 'sure enough, as expected' says that something turned out just as you thought: 我说今天会下雨，果然下雨了 'I said it would rain today, and sure enough it rained'. 居然 'unexpectedly, actually' is the opposite: you did not expect it. 他居然忘了自己的生日 'He actually forgot his own birthday'. 居然 is like 竟然 (HSK 4) and a little more common in speech.", "似乎 'it seems, seemingly' makes a careful guess from what you see: 他今天似乎不太高兴 'He seems not very happy today'. 仿佛 'as if' compares, and often ends with 似的: 她仿佛没听见似的，继续看书 'She keeps reading as if she did not hear'."], "examples": [{"zh": "我说今天会下雨，果然下雨了。", "py": "Wǒ shuō jīntiān huì xiàyǔ, guǒrán xiàyǔ le.", "en": "I said it would rain today, and sure enough it rained."}, {"zh": "他居然忘了自己的生日。", "py": "Tā jūrán wàng le zìjǐ de shēngrì.", "en": "He actually forgot his own birthday."}, {"zh": "他今天似乎不太高兴。", "py": "Tā jīntiān sìhū bú tài gāoxìng.", "en": "He seems not very happy today."}, {"zh": "她仿佛没听见似的，继续看书。", "py": "Tā fǎngfú méi tīngjiàn shìde, jìxù kàn shū.", "en": "She keeps reading as if she did not hear."}], "mistakes": ["果然 is for what you expected. If you are surprised, use 居然 or 竟然: 他居然没来 'He actually did not come'.", "似乎 is for a guess, not for a fact you know. Do not say 他似乎是我的老师 when you know he is."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "我说今天会下雨，果然下雨了。", "py": "Wǒ shuō jīntiān huì xiàyǔ, guǒrán xiàyǔ le.", "en": "I said it would rain today, and sure enough it rained."}, "explain": "果然 = it turned out as expected.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: I said it would rain today, and sure enough it rained.", "toks": ["我", "说", "今天", "会", "下雨", "果然", "下雨", "了"], "reveal": "我说今天会下雨，果然下雨了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他居然忘了自己的生日。", "py": "Tā jūrán wàng le zìjǐ de shēngrì.", "en": "He actually forgot his own birthday."}, "explain": "居然 shows surprise.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He actually forgot his own birthday.", "toks": ["他", "居然", "忘", "了", "自己", "的", "生日"], "reveal": "他居然忘了自己的生日。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他今天似乎不太高兴。", "py": "Tā jīntiān sìhū bú tài gāoxìng.", "en": "He seems not very happy today."}, "explain": "似乎 = it seems.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "他今天___不太高兴。", "sub": "He seems not very happy today.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["sihu", "似乎"], "reveal": "似乎 · sìhū"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他居然没来。", "py": "Tā jūrán méi lái.", "en": "To my surprise, he did not come."}, "explain": "居然 = unexpectedly; 果然 = as expected.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: To my surprise, he did not come?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他居然没来。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他果然没来。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他居然没来。", "levelOnly": ["他果然没来。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他居然把钱忘在家里了。", "py": "Tā jūrán bǎ qián wàng zài jiā lǐ le.", "en": "He actually left his money at home."}, "explain": "居然 and 果然 do not go together.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "居然", "果然", "把", "钱", "忘", "在", "家", "里", "了"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "他居然把钱忘在家里了。", "levelOnly": ["他居然果然把钱忘在家里了。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "congkan", "title": "从…来看, 拿…来说 and 在…看来: judging from, for example, in one's view", "cat": "Reasons, results and basis", "catOrder": 16, "catBlurb": "Say what you judge from, what something rests on, and what follows from it: judging from, from this, in short, by, on the basis of.", "covers": [16, 17, 18], "formula": [{"t": "从", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Evidence", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "来看", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Judgement", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["从 … 来看 'judging from …' gives the basis for a judgement. Put what you look at between 从 and 来看: 从天气来看，明天会下雨 'Judging from the weather, it will rain tomorrow'; 从他的成绩来看，他学得很好 'Judging from his results, he is studying well'.", "拿 … 来说 'take … for example, as for …' picks one case to show a general point: 拿我来说，我每天都跑步 'Take me, for example: I run every day'. The case after 拿 is a person or a thing, and the main sentence says something about it.", "在 … 看来 'in … view, as … sees it' gives an opinion. What follows 在 is a person or a group: 在我看来，这个计划太难了 'In my view, this plan is too hard'. 在 … 看来 is a person's opinion; 从 … 来看 is about the evidence you look at."], "examples": [{"zh": "从天气来看，明天会下雨。", "py": "Cóng tiānqì lái kàn, míngtiān huì xiàyǔ.", "en": "Judging from the weather, it will rain tomorrow."}, {"zh": "从他的成绩来看，他学得很好。", "py": "Cóng tā de chéngjì lái kàn, tā xué de hěn hǎo.", "en": "Judging from his results, he is studying well."}, {"zh": "拿我来说，我每天都跑步。", "py": "Ná wǒ lái shuō, wǒ měitiān dōu pǎobù.", "en": "Take me, for example: I run every day."}, {"zh": "在我看来，这个计划太难了。", "py": "Zài wǒ kànlái, zhège jìhuà tài nán le.", "en": "In my view, this plan is too hard."}], "mistakes": ["来看 closes the 从 phrase: 从天气来看 is right; 从来看天气 is wrong.", "在 … 看来 needs a person or a group: 在老师看来 'in the teacher's view'. Do not put a thing there: 在天气看来 is wrong."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "从天气来看，明天会下雨。", "py": "Cóng tiānqì lái kàn, míngtiān huì xiàyǔ.", "en": "Judging from the weather, it will rain tomorrow."}, "explain": "从 + evidence + 来看.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Judging from the weather, it will rain tomorrow.", "toks": ["从", "天气", "来", "看", "明天", "会", "下雨"], "reveal": "从天气来看，明天会下雨。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "拿我来说，我每天都跑步。", "py": "Ná wǒ lái shuō, wǒ měitiān dōu pǎobù.", "en": "Take me, for example: I run every day."}, "explain": "拿 + example + 来说.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Take me, for example: I run every day.", "toks": ["拿", "我", "来", "说", "我", "每天", "都", "跑步"], "reveal": "拿我来说，我每天都跑步。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "在我看来，这个计划太难了。", "py": "Zài wǒ kànlái, zhège jìhuà tài nán le.", "en": "In my view, this plan is too hard."}, "explain": "在 + person + 看来 = in someone's view.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "___我看来，这个计划太难了。", "sub": "In my view, this plan is too hard.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["zai", "在"], "reveal": "在 · zài"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "从他的成绩来看，他学得很好。", "py": "Cóng tā de chéngjì lái kàn, tā xué de hěn hǎo.", "en": "Judging from his results, he is studying well."}, "explain": "来看 comes after the evidence.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: Judging from his results, he is studying well?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "从他的成绩来看，他学得很好。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "从来看他的成绩，他学得很好。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "从他的成绩来看，他学得很好。", "levelOnly": ["从来看他的成绩，他学得很好。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "在老师看来，这个办法很好。", "py": "Zài lǎoshī kànlái, zhège bànfǎ hěn hǎo.", "en": "In the teacher's view, this method is good."}, "explain": "Do not put 的 inside 在 … 看来.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["在", "老师", "的", "看来", "这个", "办法", "很", "好"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "在老师看来，这个办法很好。", "levelOnly": ["在老师的看来，这个办法很好。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "youci", "title": "由此, 总之 and 到…为止: from this, in short, up to", "cat": "Reasons, results and basis", "catOrder": 16, "catBlurb": "Say what you judge from, what something rests on, and what follows from it: judging from, from this, in short, by, on the basis of.", "covers": [19, 20], "formula": [{"t": "Fact", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "，", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "由此可见", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Conclusion", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["由此 'from this, hence' leads to a conclusion drawn from what was just said, mostly in writing. 由此可见 'from this it can be seen' is the usual set phrase: 他每天学习五个小时，由此可见，他很努力 'He studies five hours a day; from this it can be seen that he works hard'. 总之 'in short, anyway' sums up several points and starts the closing sentence: 总之，我们要努力学习 'In short, we must study hard'.", "到 … 为止 'up to …, until …' marks an end point. The thing after 到 is a time or a stage: 到今天为止，我已经学了一百个词 'Up to today, I have learned one hundred words'; 活动到下周五为止 'The event runs until next Friday'. 为 is read wéi here."], "examples": [{"zh": "他每天学习五个小时，由此可见，他很努力。", "py": "Tā měitiān xuéxí wǔ ge xiǎoshí, yóucǐ kějiàn, tā hěn nǔlì.", "en": "He studies five hours a day; from this it can be seen that he works hard."}, {"zh": "总之，我们要努力学习。", "py": "Zǒngzhī, wǒmen yào nǔlì xuéxí.", "en": "In short, we must study hard."}, {"zh": "到今天为止，我已经学了一百个词。", "py": "Dào jīntiān wèi zhǐ, wǒ yǐjīng xué le yì bǎi ge cí.", "en": "Up to today, I have learned one hundred words."}, {"zh": "活动到下周五为止。", "py": "Huódòng dào xià zhōu wǔ wèi zhǐ.", "en": "The event runs until next Friday."}], "mistakes": ["由此 and 总之 are more written than 所以. In a casual chat, 所以 sounds more natural.", "为止 only goes with 到: say 到今天为止, not 从今天为止."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "总之，我们要努力学习。", "py": "Zǒngzhī, wǒmen yào nǔlì xuéxí.", "en": "In short, we must study hard."}, "explain": "总之 starts the closing sentence.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: In short, we must study hard.", "toks": ["总之", "我们", "要", "努力", "学习"], "reveal": "总之，我们要努力学习。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "活动到下周五为止。", "py": "Huódòng dào xià zhōu wǔ wèi zhǐ.", "en": "The event runs until next Friday."}, "explain": "到 + time + 为止.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: The event runs until next Friday.", "toks": ["活动", "到", "下", "周", "五", "为", "止"], "reveal": "活动到下周五为止。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "到今天为止，我已经学了一百个词。", "py": "Dào jīntiān wèi zhǐ, wǒ yǐjīng xué le yì bǎi ge cí.", "en": "Up to today, I have learned one hundred words."}, "explain": "到 … 为止 = up to ….", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "___今天为止，我已经学了一百个词。", "sub": "Up to today, I have learned one hundred words.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["dao", "到"], "reveal": "到 · dào"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他每天学习五个小时，由此可见，他很努力。", "py": "Tā měitiān xuéxí wǔ ge xiǎoshí, yóucǐ kějiàn, tā hěn nǔlì.", "en": "He studies five hours a day; from this it can be seen that he works hard."}, "explain": "由此可见 is the set phrase.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He studies five hours a day; from this it can be seen that he works hard?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他每天学习五个小时，由此可见，他很努力。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他每天学习五个小时，由此看他，很努力。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他每天学习五个小时，由此可见，他很努力。", "levelOnly": ["他每天学习五个小时，由此看他，很努力。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "总之，我们要努力学习。", "py": "Zǒngzhī, wǒmen yào nǔlì xuéxí.", "en": "In short, we must study hard."}, "explain": "总之 already sums up; do not add 所以.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["所以", "总之", "我们", "要", "努力", "学习"], "punct": "。", "spot": 0, "reveal": "总之，我们要努力学习。", "levelOnly": ["所以总之，我们要努力学习。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "ping", "title": "凭, 依据 and 靠 / 依靠: relying on", "cat": "Reasons, results and basis", "catOrder": 16, "catBlurb": "Say what you judge from, what something rests on, and what follows from it: judging from, from this, in short, by, on the basis of.", "covers": [21, 22, 23], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "凭 / 依据 / 靠", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "What it rests on", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["凭 'on the strength of, by' + noun says what makes something possible: 他凭努力考上了大学 'He got into university by working hard'. 凭借 is the formal form: 他凭借自己的经验解决了问题 'He solved the problem by means of his own experience'. 凭什么 asks 'on what grounds?' and sounds sharp: 你凭什么这样说？ 'What gives you the right to say this?'", "依据 'on the basis of' + noun is written: 依据这个规定，大家都要早点来 'According to this rule, everyone must come early'. 依据 is also a noun, 'basis': 这个办法没有依据 'This method has no basis'. 根据 (HSK 3) is the everyday word.", "靠 and 依靠 'rely on, depend on' say whom or what one depends on: 他靠写文章生活 'He lives by writing articles'; 孩子需要依靠父母 'Children need to rely on their parents'. 靠 also means 'to lean on': 靠在墙上 'lean on the wall'."], "examples": [{"zh": "他凭努力考上了大学。", "py": "Tā píng nǔlì kǎo shàng le dàxué.", "en": "He got into university by working hard."}, {"zh": "他凭借自己的经验解决了问题。", "py": "Tā píngjiè zìjǐ de jīngyàn jiějué le wèntí.", "en": "He solved the problem by means of his own experience."}, {"zh": "依据这个规定，大家都要早点来。", "py": "Yījù zhège guīdìng, dàjiā dōu yào zǎo diǎn lái.", "en": "According to this rule, everyone must come early."}, {"zh": "他靠写文章生活。", "py": "Tā kào xiě wénzhāng shēnghuó.", "en": "He lives by writing articles."}], "mistakes": ["凭 goes before the verb, with what it rests on right after it: 他凭努力考上了大学. 他考上了大学凭努力 is wrong.", "凭什么 is a sharp 'on what grounds?'. For a polite question, use 为什么."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "他凭努力考上了大学。", "py": "Tā píng nǔlì kǎo shàng le dàxué.", "en": "He got into university by working hard."}, "explain": "凭 + what it rests on + verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He got into university by working hard.", "toks": ["他", "凭", "努力", "考", "上", "了", "大学"], "reveal": "他凭努力考上了大学。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他靠写文章生活。", "py": "Tā kào xiě wénzhāng shēnghuó.", "en": "He lives by writing articles."}, "explain": "靠 + what one depends on.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He lives by writing articles.", "toks": ["他", "靠", "写", "文章", "生活"], "reveal": "他靠写文章生活。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "依据这个规定，大家都要早点来。", "py": "Yījù zhège guīdìng, dàjiā dōu yào zǎo diǎn lái.", "en": "According to this rule, everyone must come early."}, "explain": "依据 + rule = on the basis of.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "___这个规定，大家都要早点来。", "sub": "According to this rule, everyone must come early.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["yiju", "依据"], "reveal": "依据 · yījù"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "孩子需要依靠父母。", "py": "Háizi xūyào yīkào fùmǔ.", "en": "Children need to rely on their parents."}, "explain": "依靠 + the one relied on.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: Children need to rely on their parents?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "孩子需要依靠父母。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "孩子需要父母依靠。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "孩子需要依靠父母。", "levelOnly": ["孩子需要父母依靠。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他凭努力考上了大学。", "py": "Tā píng nǔlì kǎo shàng le dàxué.", "en": "He got into university by working hard."}, "explain": "Do not put 是 after 凭.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "凭", "是", "努力", "考", "上", "了", "大学"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "他凭努力考上了大学。", "levelOnly": ["他凭是努力考上了大学。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "jiang", "title": "将, 由 and 所…的: formal 把, by, what someone …", "cat": "Formal and written style", "catOrder": 17, "catBlurb": "Written and formal ways to say things you already know in speech: 将, 由, 所, 令, 彼此 and 如此.", "covers": [24, 25, 26], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "将", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Thing", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb + more", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["将 is a formal 把 in writing: 请将书放在桌子上 'Please put the book on the table'; 他将这件事告诉了大家 'He told everyone about this'. The pattern is the same as 把: 将 + thing + verb + something extra after the verb.", "由 'by, up to' tells who is responsible: 这件事由他来做 'He will take care of this'; 由你决定 'It is up to you'. It also names who does a job in a formal sentence: 这次会议由经理主持 'This meeting is chaired by the manager'.", "所 + verb + 的 turns a verb into 'what someone …': 这是我所知道的 'This is what I know'; 他所说的都是真的 'Everything he says is true'. 所 is formal; in speech say 我知道的 or 他说的."], "examples": [{"zh": "请将书放在桌子上。", "py": "Qǐng jiāng shū fàng zài zhuōzi shàng.", "en": "Please put the book on the table."}, {"zh": "这件事由他来做。", "py": "Zhè jiàn shì yóu tā lái zuò.", "en": "He will take care of this."}, {"zh": "这次会议由经理主持。", "py": "Zhè cì huìyì yóu jīnglǐ zhǔchí.", "en": "This meeting is chaired by the manager."}, {"zh": "他所说的都是真的。", "py": "Tā suǒ shuō de dōu shì zhēn de.", "en": "Everything he says is true."}], "mistakes": ["将 is for writing and formal speech. In daily talk, 把 is more natural: 请把书放在桌子上.", "Do not use 由 for transport. Say 坐火车 'go by train', not 由火车."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "请将书放在桌子上。", "py": "Qǐng jiāng shū fàng zài zhuōzi shàng.", "en": "Please put the book on the table."}, "explain": "将 + thing + verb + place.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Please put the book on the table.", "toks": ["请", "将", "书", "放", "在", "桌子", "上"], "reveal": "请将书放在桌子上。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这次会议由经理主持。", "py": "Zhè cì huìyì yóu jīnglǐ zhǔchí.", "en": "This meeting is chaired by the manager."}, "explain": "由 + the person in charge.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: This meeting is chaired by the manager.", "toks": ["这", "次", "会议", "由", "经理", "主持"], "reveal": "这次会议由经理主持。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他所说的都是真的。", "py": "Tā suǒ shuō de dōu shì zhēn de.", "en": "Everything he says is true."}, "explain": "所 + verb + 的 = what someone ….", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "他___说的都是真的。", "sub": "Everything he says is true.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["suo", "所"], "reveal": "所 · suǒ"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这件事由他来做。", "py": "Zhè jiàn shì yóu tā lái zuò.", "en": "He will take care of this."}, "explain": "由 comes before the person.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He will take care of this?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "这件事由他来做。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "这件事他由来做。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "这件事由他来做。", "levelOnly": ["这件事他由来做。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "请将书放在桌子上。", "py": "Qǐng jiāng shū fàng zài zhuōzi shàng.", "en": "Please put the book on the table."}, "explain": "将 and 把 do not go together.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["请", "将", "把", "书", "放", "在", "桌子", "上"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "请将书放在桌子上。", "levelOnly": ["请将把书放在桌子上。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "ling", "title": "令, 使 and 让: make someone feel", "cat": "Formal and written style", "catOrder": 17, "catBlurb": "Written and formal ways to say things you already know in speech: 将, 由, 所, 令, 彼此 and 如此.", "covers": [27], "formula": [{"t": "Cause", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "令 / 使 / 让", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Person", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Feeling", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["令 + person + feeling means 'make someone feel …', in writing: 这个消息令大家很高兴 'This news makes everyone very happy'; 他的话令我很感动 'His words move me very much'. 使 (HSK 4) works the same way and is formal too: 这个结果使老师很满意 'This result makes the teacher very satisfied'. 让 is the everyday word: 这个消息让我很高兴.", "令人 + adjective is a fixed way to say 'it makes people …': 令人吃惊 'surprising', 令人满意 'satisfying', 令人担心 'worrying'. The person who feels it must come after 令, 使 or 让."], "examples": [{"zh": "这个消息令大家很高兴。", "py": "Zhège xiāoxi lìng dàjiā hěn gāoxìng.", "en": "This news makes everyone very happy."}, {"zh": "他的话令我很感动。", "py": "Tā dehuà lìng wǒ hěn gǎndòng.", "en": "His words move me very much."}, {"zh": "这件事令人吃惊。", "py": "Zhè jiàn shì lìng rén chījīng.", "en": "This matter is surprising."}, {"zh": "这个结果使老师很满意。", "py": "Zhège jiéguǒ shǐ lǎoshī hěn mǎnyì.", "en": "This result makes the teacher very satisfied."}], "mistakes": ["令 is for writing. In speech use 让: 这个消息让我很高兴.", "A person must come after 令, 使 or 让. 这个消息令很高兴 is wrong, because it does not say who is happy."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "这个消息令大家很高兴。", "py": "Zhège xiāoxi lìng dàjiā hěn gāoxìng.", "en": "This news makes everyone very happy."}, "explain": "令 + person + feeling.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: This news makes everyone very happy.", "toks": ["这个", "消息", "令", "大家", "很", "高兴"], "reveal": "这个消息令大家很高兴。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这件事令人吃惊。", "py": "Zhè jiàn shì lìng rén chījīng.", "en": "This matter is surprising."}, "explain": "令人 + adjective.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: This matter is surprising.", "toks": ["这", "件", "事", "令", "人", "吃惊"], "reveal": "这件事令人吃惊。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这个结果使老师很满意。", "py": "Zhège jiéguǒ shǐ lǎoshī hěn mǎnyì.", "en": "This result makes the teacher very satisfied."}, "explain": "使 + person + feeling.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "这个结果___老师很满意。", "sub": "This result makes the teacher very satisfied.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["shi", "使"], "reveal": "使 · shǐ"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这个消息让我很高兴。", "py": "Zhège xiāoxi ràng wǒ hěn gāoxìng.", "en": "This news makes me very happy."}, "explain": "The person comes before the feeling.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: This news makes me very happy?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "这个消息让我很高兴。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "这个消息让很高兴我。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "这个消息让我很高兴。", "levelOnly": ["这个消息让很高兴我。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他的话令我很感动。", "py": "Tā dehuà lìng wǒ hěn gǎndòng.", "en": "His words move me very much."}, "explain": "Use only one of 令 and 让.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "的话", "令", "我", "让", "很", "感动"], "punct": "。", "spot": 4, "reveal": "他的话令我很感动。", "levelOnly": ["他的话令我让很感动。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "bici", "title": "彼此 and 如此: each other, so", "cat": "Formal and written style", "catOrder": 17, "catBlurb": "Written and formal ways to say things you already know in speech: 将, 由, 所, 令, 彼此 and 如此.", "covers": [28, 29], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "彼此", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["彼此 'each other, one another' shows that both sides do the same thing to each other: 我们彼此了解 'We understand each other'; 同学们彼此帮助 'The classmates help each other'. It is like 互相 (HSK 4) but more formal. 对方 (HSK 4) points to one person on the other side: 我了解对方 'I understand the other person'.", "如此 'so, like this' stands for a degree or way that was just mentioned: 他如此努力，一定会成功 'He works so hard that he will surely succeed'; 事情就是如此 'That is how things are'. 如此 is written; in speech say 这么 or 这样."], "examples": [{"zh": "我们彼此了解。", "py": "Wǒmen bǐcǐ liǎojiě.", "en": "We understand each other."}, {"zh": "同学们彼此帮助。", "py": "Tóngxuémen bǐcǐ bāngzhù.", "en": "The classmates help each other."}, {"zh": "他如此努力，一定会成功。", "py": "Tā rúcǐ nǔlì, yídìng huì chénggōng.", "en": "He works so hard that he will surely succeed."}, {"zh": "事情就是如此。", "py": "Shìqing jiùshì rúcǐ.", "en": "That is how things are."}], "mistakes": ["彼此 already means 'each other', so do not add 互相: 彼此互相帮助 repeats the idea.", "如此 is formal. In daily speech say 这么 or 这样: 他这么努力."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "我们彼此了解。", "py": "Wǒmen bǐcǐ liǎojiě.", "en": "We understand each other."}, "explain": "彼此 + verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: We understand each other.", "toks": ["我们", "彼此", "了解"], "reveal": "我们彼此了解。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "事情就是如此。", "py": "Shìqing jiùshì rúcǐ.", "en": "That is how things are."}, "explain": "如此 = like this.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: That is how things are.", "toks": ["事情", "就是", "如此"], "reveal": "事情就是如此。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他如此努力，一定会成功。", "py": "Tā rúcǐ nǔlì, yídìng huì chénggōng.", "en": "He works so hard that he will surely succeed."}, "explain": "如此 = so, to such a degree.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "他___努力，一定会成功。", "sub": "He works so hard that he will surely succeed.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["ruci", "如此"], "reveal": "如此 · rúcǐ"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "同学们彼此帮助。", "py": "Tóngxuémen bǐcǐ bāngzhù.", "en": "The classmates help each other."}, "explain": "彼此 comes before the verb.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: The classmates help each other?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "同学们彼此帮助。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "同学们帮助彼此帮助。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "同学们彼此帮助。", "levelOnly": ["同学们帮助彼此帮助。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "同学们彼此帮助。", "py": "Tóngxuémen bǐcǐ bāngzhù.", "en": "The classmates help each other."}, "explain": "彼此 already means 'each other'.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["同学", "们", "彼此", "互相", "帮助"], "punct": "。", "spot": 3, "reveal": "同学们彼此帮助。", "levelOnly": ["同学们彼此互相帮助。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "guyu", "title": "过于, 稍, 够…的 and 可: too, a little, quite, really", "cat": "Describing and comparing", "catOrder": 2, "catBlurb": "Say what something is like, compare things, say how much, and say how well or how completely something is done.", "covers": [30, 31, 32, 33], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "过于", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Adjective / verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["过于 'too, excessively' goes before an adjective or a verb and says that something goes past the right amount: 这个问题过于简单 'This question is too simple'; 你不要过于担心 'Do not worry too much'. It is more formal than 太, and it usually sounds like a complaint, so do not use it for praise.", "稍 'a little, slightly' goes before a verb or an adjective: 请稍等一下 'Please wait a moment'; 这件衣服稍大一点儿 'This piece of clothing is a little big'. With an adjective, add 一点儿 or 一些 to show the amount. 稍 is mostly written; 稍微 (HSK 4) is the everyday form.", "够 … 的 'quite, rather' puts an adjective between 够 and 的 and adds a feeling of surprise or complaint: 今天够冷的 'It is quite cold today'; 这个问题够难的 'This question is quite hard'. 够 alone just means 'enough'.", "可 'really, indeed' adds force in speech to a warning, a promise or an opinion: 你可要小心啊 'You must be careful'; 这可是个好机会 'This really is a good chance'; 这件事可不容易 'This really is not easy'. This 可 is not the 可 that means 'but'. It often comes with 要, 别, 是, 不 or 真."], "examples": [{"zh": "这个问题过于简单。", "py": "Zhège wèntí guòyú jiǎndān.", "en": "This question is too simple."}, {"zh": "请稍等一下。", "py": "Qǐng shāo děng yíxià.", "en": "Please wait a moment."}, {"zh": "今天够冷的，多穿一点儿吧。", "py": "Jīntiān gòu lěng de, duō chuān yìdiǎnr ba.", "en": "It is quite cold today; wear a bit more."}, {"zh": "你可要小心啊！", "py": "Nǐ kě yào xiǎoxīn a!", "en": "You must be careful!"}], "mistakes": ["过于 sounds like a complaint. For something good, say 非常 or 很: 非常好, not 过于好.", "Do not stack two degree words. 过于太 is wrong; use one of them."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "这个问题过于简单。", "py": "Zhège wèntí guòyú jiǎndān.", "en": "This question is too simple."}, "explain": "过于 + adjective.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: This question is too simple.", "toks": ["这个", "问题", "过于", "简单"], "reveal": "这个问题过于简单。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "请稍等一下。", "py": "Qǐng shāo děng yíxià.", "en": "Please wait a moment."}, "explain": "稍 + verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Please wait a moment.", "toks": ["请", "稍", "等", "一下"], "reveal": "请稍等一下。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "今天够冷的，多穿一点儿吧。", "py": "Jīntiān gòu lěng de, duō chuān yìdiǎnr ba.", "en": "It is quite cold today; wear a bit more."}, "explain": "够 + adjective + 的 = quite.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "今天___冷的，多穿一点儿吧。", "sub": "It is quite cold today; wear a bit more.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["gou", "够"], "reveal": "够 · gòu"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "你可要小心啊！", "py": "Nǐ kě yào xiǎoxīn a!", "en": "You must be careful!"}, "explain": "可 + 要 + verb.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: You must be careful?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "你可要小心啊！"}, {"id": "b", "label": "你可小心要啊！"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "你可要小心啊！", "levelOnly": ["你可小心要啊！"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "你不要过于担心。", "py": "Nǐ búyào guòyú dānxīn.", "en": "Do not worry too much."}, "explain": "Use only one degree word.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["你", "不要", "过于", "太", "担心"], "punct": "。", "spot": 3, "reveal": "你不要过于担心。", "levelOnly": ["你不要过于太担心。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "shichang", "title": "将要, 时常, 时刻, 立刻 and 立即: about to, often, always, at once", "cat": "Time and how often", "catOrder": 7, "catBlurb": "Dates and clock time, how often something happens, when, and for how long.", "covers": [34, 35, 36], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "将要", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["将要 'be about to, will soon' goes before a verb: 比赛将要开始 'The match is about to start'; 我们将要搬到新家 'We will move to a new home soon'. 将要 is formal and usually does not end with 了. In speech, say 快要 … 了 or 就要 … 了 (HSK 3).", "时常 'often' goes before the verb: 他时常去公园跑步 'He often goes to the park to run'. 经常 (HSK 3) is the everyday word. 时刻 as an adverb means 'at every moment, always', and stresses doing something all the time: 我们要时刻注意安全 'We must pay attention to safety at all times'.", "立刻 and 立即 'at once, immediately' go before the verb: 听到电话响，他立刻跑了过去 'Hearing the phone ring, he ran over at once'; 请立即回家 'Please go home at once'. 立即 is more formal and is common in orders and notices. In speech, 马上 (HSK 3) is the usual word."], "examples": [{"zh": "比赛将要开始。", "py": "Bǐsài jiāngyào kāishǐ.", "en": "The match is about to start."}, {"zh": "他时常去公园跑步。", "py": "Tā shícháng qù gōngyuán pǎobù.", "en": "He often goes to the park to run."}, {"zh": "我们要时刻注意安全。", "py": "Wǒmen yào shíkè zhùyì ānquán.", "en": "We must pay attention to safety at all times."}, {"zh": "听到电话响，他立刻跑了过去。", "py": "Tīng dào diànhuà xiǎng, tā lìkè pǎo le guòqù.", "en": "Hearing the phone ring, he ran over at once."}], "mistakes": ["将要 does not usually take 了 at the end. For 'is about to start', say 比赛快要开始了.", "立刻 and 立即 go before the verb, not after it: 他立刻跑了过去, not 他跑了过去立刻."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "比赛将要开始。", "py": "Bǐsài jiāngyào kāishǐ.", "en": "The match is about to start."}, "explain": "将要 + verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: The match is about to start.", "toks": ["比赛", "将要", "开始"], "reveal": "比赛将要开始。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "请立即回家。", "py": "Qǐng lìjí huí jiā.", "en": "Please go home at once."}, "explain": "立即 goes before the verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Please go home at once.", "toks": ["请", "立即", "回", "家"], "reveal": "请立即回家。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他时常去公园跑步。", "py": "Tā shícháng qù gōngyuán pǎobù.", "en": "He often goes to the park to run."}, "explain": "时常 = often.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "他___去公园跑步。", "sub": "He often goes to the park to run.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["shichang", "时常"], "reveal": "时常 · shícháng"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我们要时刻注意安全。", "py": "Wǒmen yào shíkè zhùyì ānquán.", "en": "We must pay attention to safety at all times."}, "explain": "时刻 goes before the verb.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: We must pay attention to safety at all times?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "我们要时刻注意安全。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "我们要注意安全时刻。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "我们要时刻注意安全。", "levelOnly": ["我们要注意安全时刻。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "听到电话响，他立刻跑了过去。", "py": "Tīng dào diànhuà xiǎng, tā lìkè pǎo le guòqù.", "en": "Hearing the phone ring, he ran over at once."}, "explain": "立刻 and 马上 mean the same; use one.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["听", "到", "电话", "响", "他", "立刻", "马上", "跑", "了", "过去"], "punct": "。", "spot": 6, "reveal": "听到电话响，他立刻跑了过去。", "levelOnly": ["听到电话响，他立刻马上跑了过去。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "jianjian", "title": "渐渐, 始终 and 连续: gradually, all along, in a row", "cat": "Time and how often", "catOrder": 7, "catBlurb": "Dates and clock time, how often something happens, when, and for how long.", "covers": [37, 38, 39], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "渐渐", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb / adjective", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "了", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["渐渐 and 逐渐 'gradually, little by little' show a change that comes slowly. They go before the verb or adjective and often end with 了: 天渐渐黑了 'It is getting dark'; 他的汉语逐渐好起来了 'His Chinese has gradually got better'. 逐步 'step by step' is for planned progress: 公司逐步扩大了 'The company has gradually grown bigger'.", "始终 'all along, from start to finish' says that something never changed: 他始终没有告诉我这件事 'He never told me about this'; 她始终相信自己会成功 'She always believes she will succeed'. It often goes with 没 or 不 for 'never at any point'. 一直 (HSK 3) is the everyday word.", "连续 'in a row' goes with a number of days, times or years: 他连续三天没有睡觉 'He did not sleep for three days in a row'. 持续 'go on, last' stresses one stretch that does not stop: 雨持续下了一个星期 'The rain went on for a week'. 连续 counts events one after another; 持续 is a single long stretch."], "examples": [{"zh": "天渐渐黑了。", "py": "Tiān jiànjiàn hēi le.", "en": "It is getting dark."}, {"zh": "他的汉语逐渐好起来了。", "py": "Tā de Hànyǔ zhújiàn hǎo qǐlái le.", "en": "His Chinese has gradually got better."}, {"zh": "她始终相信自己会成功。", "py": "Tā shǐzhōng xiāngxìn zìjǐ huì chénggōng.", "en": "She always believes she will succeed."}, {"zh": "他连续三天没有睡觉。", "py": "Tā liánxù sān tiān méiyǒu shuìjiào.", "en": "He did not sleep for three days in a row."}], "mistakes": ["渐渐 and 逐渐 need a change. 天渐渐黑了 is right; for a fixed fact, 他渐渐是老师 is wrong.", "持续 does not go with a count of separate events. Say 他连续三次来我家, not 他持续三次来我家."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "天渐渐黑了。", "py": "Tiān jiànjiàn hēi le.", "en": "It is getting dark."}, "explain": "渐渐 + change + 了.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: It is getting dark.", "toks": ["天", "渐渐", "黑", "了"], "reveal": "天渐渐黑了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他连续三天没有睡觉。", "py": "Tā liánxù sān tiān méiyǒu shuìjiào.", "en": "He did not sleep for three days in a row."}, "explain": "连续 + number of days.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He did not sleep for three days in a row.", "toks": ["他", "连续", "三", "天", "没有", "睡觉"], "reveal": "他连续三天没有睡觉。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "她始终相信自己会成功。", "py": "Tā shǐzhōng xiāngxìn zìjǐ huì chénggōng.", "en": "She always believes she will succeed."}, "explain": "始终 = all along.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "她___相信自己会成功。", "sub": "She always believes she will succeed.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["shizhong", "始终"], "reveal": "始终 · shǐzhōng"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "雨持续下了一个星期。", "py": "Yǔ chíxù xià le yí ge xīngqī.", "en": "The rain went on for a week."}, "explain": "持续 + verb + length of time.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: The rain went on for a week?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "雨持续下了一个星期。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "雨持续了下一个星期。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "雨持续下了一个星期。", "levelOnly": ["雨持续了下一个星期。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "公司逐步扩大了。", "py": "Gōngsī zhúbù kuòdà le.", "en": "The company has gradually grown bigger."}, "explain": "逐步 and 渐渐 mean the same; use one.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["公司", "逐步", "渐渐", "扩大", "了"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "公司逐步扩大了。", "levelOnly": ["公司逐步渐渐扩大了。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "suihou", "title": "再次, 随后, 此后, 先后 and 陆续: again, afterwards, one after another", "cat": "Time and how often", "catOrder": 7, "catBlurb": "Dates and clock time, how often something happens, when, and for how long.", "covers": [40, 41, 42], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "再次", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["再次 'once more, again' goes before the verb. It is more formal than 又 or 再, and it can look back or ahead: 我再次见到了老朋友 'I saw my old friend again'; 请再次检查 'Please check again'.", "随后, 此后 and 此时 tie an event to a point in time. 随后 'soon after, then' follows straight after something: 他先吃了饭，随后就去上班了 'He ate first and then went to work'. 此后 'from then on, after that' starts a stretch of time after that point: 此后，他每天都来这里 'After that, he comes here every day'. 此时 'at this moment' points to one moment: 此时，天已经黑了 'At this moment, it was already dark'.", "先后 and 陆续 'one after another' need more than one person, thing or time. 先后 gives the order, often with a number: 他先后去过三个国家 'He has been to three countries, one after another'. 陆续 stresses a steady stream, not all at once: 客人们陆续到了 'The guests arrived one after another'."], "examples": [{"zh": "我再次见到了老朋友。", "py": "Wǒ zàicì jiàn dào le lǎopéngyou.", "en": "I saw my old friend again."}, {"zh": "他先吃了饭，随后就去上班了。", "py": "Tā xiān chī le fàn, suíhòu jiù qù shàngbān le.", "en": "He ate first and then went to work."}, {"zh": "此时，天已经黑了。", "py": "Cǐshí, tiān yǐjīng hēi le.", "en": "At this moment, it was already dark."}, {"zh": "客人们陆续到了。", "py": "Kèrénmen lùxù dào le.", "en": "The guests arrived one after another."}], "mistakes": ["随后 follows straight after the first event. For a gap of weeks or years, 后来 is better.", "先后 and 陆续 need more than one. 客人们陆续到了 is right; 他陆续到了 is wrong, because one person cannot arrive 'one after another'."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "请再次检查。", "py": "Qǐng zàicì jiǎnchá.", "en": "Please check again."}, "explain": "再次 goes before the verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Please check again.", "toks": ["请", "再次", "检查"], "reveal": "请再次检查。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "此时，天已经黑了。", "py": "Cǐshí, tiān yǐjīng hēi le.", "en": "At this moment, it was already dark."}, "explain": "此时 starts the clause.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: At this moment, it was already dark.", "toks": ["此时", "天", "已经", "黑", "了"], "reveal": "此时，天已经黑了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "客人们陆续到了。", "py": "Kèrénmen lùxù dào le.", "en": "The guests arrived one after another."}, "explain": "陆续 = one after another.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "客人们___到了。", "sub": "The guests arrived one after another.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["luxu", "陆续"], "reveal": "陆续 · lùxù"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他先后去过三个国家。", "py": "Tā xiānhòu qù guo sān ge guójiā.", "en": "He has been to three countries, one after another."}, "explain": "先后 goes before the verb.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He has been to three countries, one after another?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他先后去过三个国家。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他去过先后三个国家。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他先后去过三个国家。", "levelOnly": ["他去过先后三个国家。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他先吃了饭，随后就去上班了。", "py": "Tā xiān chī le fàn, suíhòu jiù qù shàngbān le.", "en": "He ate first and then went to work."}, "explain": "随后 and 然后 both mean 'then'; use one.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "先", "吃", "了", "饭", "随后", "然后", "就", "去", "上班", "了"], "punct": "。", "spot": 6, "reveal": "他先吃了饭，随后就去上班了。", "levelOnly": ["他先吃了饭，随后然后就去上班了。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "jianzhi", "title": "简直, 绝对, 根本 and 难以: simply, absolutely, at all, hard to", "cat": "Describing and comparing", "catOrder": 2, "catBlurb": "Say what something is like, compare things, say how much, and say how well or how completely something is done.", "covers": [43, 44, 45, 46], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "根本", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "不 / 没", "k": false, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["简直 'simply, practically' adds strong feeling to an adjective or a verb. The speaker sounds amazed or is exaggerating: 今天简直太热了 'Today is simply too hot'; 这里的风景简直像画一样 'The scenery here is simply like a painting'. It shows a feeling, not a fact, so it goes with words like 太, 像 and 是.", "绝对 'absolutely' marks something as certain. With a negative it means 'never, under no circumstances': 这件事绝对不能告诉别人 'This absolutely cannot be told to anyone'. With a positive, it means 'for sure': 你绝对可以相信他 'You can absolutely trust him'. 这个答案绝对没有错 'There is absolutely no mistake in this answer'.", "根本 'at all' goes before 不 or 没 and denies in full: 我根本不知道这件事 'I do not know about this at all'; 他根本没来 'He did not come at all'. In a positive sentence, 根本 is not 'completely'; as a noun it means 'root, basis'.", "难以 'hard to' goes before a verb of two syllables: 这个问题难以解决 'This problem is hard to solve'; 那次旅行让我难以忘记 'That trip is hard for me to forget'. It is more formal than 很难 and is used for things like understanding, believing and accepting, not for plain physical actions."], "examples": [{"zh": "今天简直太热了。", "py": "Jīntiān jiǎnzhí tài rè le.", "en": "Today is simply too hot."}, {"zh": "这件事绝对不能告诉别人。", "py": "Zhè jiàn shì juéduì bù néng gàosu biérén.", "en": "This absolutely cannot be told to anyone."}, {"zh": "我根本不知道这件事。", "py": "Wǒ gēnběn bù zhīdào zhè jiàn shì.", "en": "I do not know about this at all."}, {"zh": "这个问题难以解决。", "py": "Zhège wèntí nányǐ jiějué.", "en": "This problem is hard to solve."}], "mistakes": ["根本 needs a negative. 我根本不知道 is right; 我根本知道 is wrong.", "难以 goes before a verb of two syllables. Say 难以理解 but 很难学, not 难以学."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "今天简直太热了。", "py": "Jīntiān jiǎnzhí tài rè le.", "en": "Today is simply too hot."}, "explain": "简直 + feeling.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Today is simply too hot.", "toks": ["今天", "简直", "太", "热", "了"], "reveal": "今天简直太热了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我根本不知道这件事。", "py": "Wǒ gēnběn bù zhīdào zhè jiàn shì.", "en": "I do not know about this at all."}, "explain": "根本 + 不 + verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: I do not know about this at all.", "toks": ["我", "根本", "不", "知道", "这", "件", "事"], "reveal": "我根本不知道这件事。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这件事绝对不能告诉别人。", "py": "Zhè jiàn shì juéduì bù néng gàosu biérén.", "en": "This absolutely cannot be told to anyone."}, "explain": "绝对 + negative = absolutely not.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "这件事___不能告诉别人。", "sub": "This absolutely cannot be told to anyone.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["juedui", "绝对"], "reveal": "绝对 · juéduì"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这个问题难以解决。", "py": "Zhège wèntí nányǐ jiějué.", "en": "This problem is hard to solve."}, "explain": "难以 goes before the verb.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: This problem is hard to solve?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "这个问题难以解决。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "这个问题解决难以。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "这个问题难以解决。", "levelOnly": ["这个问题解决难以。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他根本没来。", "py": "Tā gēnběn méi lái.", "en": "He did not come at all."}, "explain": "Do not put 是 between 根本 and 没.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "根本", "是", "没", "来"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "他根本没来。", "levelOnly": ["他根本是没来。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "jinliang", "title": "尽量, 尽力 and 万一: as far as possible, do your best, in case", "cat": "Wanting and being able", "catOrder": 5, "catBlurb": "Want, can, may, hope and get ready.", "covers": [47, 48], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "尽量", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["尽量 'as much as possible, to the fullest extent' goes before a verb and sets a goal for how much or how well: 请尽量早点来 'Please come as early as possible'; 我会尽量少吃甜的 'I will eat as little sweet food as possible'. 尽力 'do all one can' is about how hard someone tries: 我会尽力帮你 'I will do my best to help you'. 尽量 is about the degree you reach; 尽力 is about the effort you give.", "万一 'in case, if by any chance' brings in something unlikely, and usually unwelcome, that might happen. A plan or a request follows, often with 就: 万一下雨，我们就在家看电影 'In case it rains, we will watch a movie at home'; 万一你没找到我，就给我打电话 'In case you do not manage to find me, call me'."], "examples": [{"zh": "请尽量早点来。", "py": "Qǐng jǐnliàng zǎo diǎn lái.", "en": "Please come as early as possible."}, {"zh": "我会尽量少吃甜的。", "py": "Wǒ huì jǐnliàng shǎo chī tián de.", "en": "I will eat as little sweet food as possible."}, {"zh": "我会尽力帮你。", "py": "Wǒ huì jìnlì bāng nǐ.", "en": "I will do my best to help you."}, {"zh": "万一下雨，我们就在家看电影。", "py": "Wànyī xiàyǔ, wǒmen jiù zài jiā kàn diànyǐng.", "en": "In case it rains, we will watch a movie at home."}], "mistakes": ["尽量 and 尽力 are not swapped freely. Say 尽量少吃, 'eat as little as possible', not 尽力少吃.", "万一 is for something unlikely. For an ordinary 'if', use 如果: 如果明天有空，我们去看电影."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "请尽量早点来。", "py": "Qǐng jǐnliàng zǎo diǎn lái.", "en": "Please come as early as possible."}, "explain": "尽量 + verb phrase.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Please come as early as possible.", "toks": ["请", "尽量", "早", "点", "来"], "reveal": "请尽量早点来。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我会尽力帮你。", "py": "Wǒ huì jìnlì bāng nǐ.", "en": "I will do my best to help you."}, "explain": "尽力 + verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: I will do my best to help you.", "toks": ["我", "会", "尽力", "帮", "你"], "reveal": "我会尽力帮你。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "万一下雨，我们就在家看电影。", "py": "Wànyī xiàyǔ, wǒmen jiù zài jiā kàn diànyǐng.", "en": "In case it rains, we will watch a movie at home."}, "explain": "万一 = in case.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "___下雨，我们就在家看电影。", "sub": "In case it rains, we will watch a movie at home.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["wanyi", "万一"], "reveal": "万一 · wànyī"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我会尽量少吃甜的。", "py": "Wǒ huì jǐnliàng shǎo chī tián de.", "en": "I will eat as little sweet food as possible."}, "explain": "尽量 goes before the verb phrase.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: I will eat as little sweet food as possible?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "我会尽量少吃甜的。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "我会少吃尽量甜的。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "我会尽量少吃甜的。", "levelOnly": ["我会少吃尽量甜的。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "万一你没找到我，就给我打电话。", "py": "Wànyī nǐ méi zhǎo dào wǒ, jiù gěi wǒ dǎ diànhuà.", "en": "In case you do not manage to find me, call me."}, "explain": "万一 already means 'if by chance'; do not add 如果.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["万一", "你", "如果", "没", "找", "到", "我", "就", "给", "我", "打电话"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "万一你没找到我，就给我打电话。", "levelOnly": ["万一你如果没找到我，就给我打电话。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "zaiye2", "title": "再也不 / 没 and 怎么都 / 也 + 不 / 没: never again, however hard I try", "cat": "Saying no, asking and telling", "catOrder": 4, "catBlurb": "Say no, make polite requests, and tell someone not to do something.", "covers": [49, 50], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "再也", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "不 / 没", "k": false, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["再也不 + verb 'not any more, never again' says what someone will not do from now on: 我再也不会相信他了 'I will not trust him any more'; 我再也不吃那家店的菜了 'I will not eat the food from that restaurant any more'. 再也没(有) + verb says that something has not happened again since a past time: 他走了以后，再也没回来过 'After he left, he never came back again'. 不 is for a decision or a state; 没 is for what did not happen.", "怎么 + 都 / 也 + verb + 不 / 没 'however hard one tries, still not' shows that effort does not work: 这个字我怎么也写不好 'However hard I try, I do not manage to write this character well'; 我怎么都想不起来他的名字 'However hard I try, I do not manage to think of his name'. It usually goes with a 不 complement (写不好, 打不开, 想不起来). 怎么都 and 怎么也 mean the same."], "examples": [{"zh": "我再也不会相信他了。", "py": "Wǒ zài yě bú huì xiāngxìn tā le.", "en": "I will not trust him any more."}, {"zh": "他走了以后，再也没回来过。", "py": "Tā zǒu le yǐhòu, zài yě méi huílái guo.", "en": "After he left, he never came back again."}, {"zh": "这个字我怎么也写不好。", "py": "Zhège zì wǒ zěnme yě xiě bù hǎo.", "en": "However hard I try, I do not manage to write this character well."}, {"zh": "我怎么都想不起来他的名字。", "py": "Wǒ zěnme dōu xiǎng bù qǐlái tā de míngzi.", "en": "However hard I try, I do not manage to think of his name."}], "mistakes": ["再也 must be followed by 不 or 没. 再也吃 is wrong. 再 alone, as in 再吃, means 'again', which is the opposite.", "With a 不 complement, 怎么也打不开 means 'try but fail'. With 不 before the verb, 怎么也不打开 means 'refuse, however much'. They are not the same."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "我再也不会相信他了。", "py": "Wǒ zài yě bú huì xiāngxìn tā le.", "en": "I will not trust him any more."}, "explain": "再也 + 不 + verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: I will not trust him any more.", "toks": ["我", "再", "也", "不", "会", "相信", "他", "了"], "reveal": "我再也不会相信他了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我怎么也打不开门。", "py": "Wǒ zěnme yě dǎ bù kāi mén.", "en": "However hard I try, I do not manage to open the door."}, "explain": "怎么也 + verb + 不 complement.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: However hard I try, I do not manage to open the door.", "toks": ["我", "怎么", "也", "打", "不", "开", "门"], "reveal": "我怎么也打不开门。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他走了以后，再也没回来过。", "py": "Tā zǒu le yǐhòu, zài yě méi huílái guo.", "en": "After he left, he never came back again."}, "explain": "再也 + 没 = has not … again since then.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "他走了以后，再也___回来过。", "sub": "After he left, he never came back again.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["mei", "没"], "reveal": "没 · méi"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我怎么都想不起来他的名字。", "py": "Wǒ zěnme dōu xiǎng bù qǐlái tā de míngzi.", "en": "However hard I try, I do not manage to think of his name."}, "explain": "不 sits inside the complement: 想不起来.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: However hard I try, I do not manage to think of his name?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "我怎么都想不起来他的名字。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "我怎么都想起来不他的名字。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "我怎么都想不起来他的名字。", "levelOnly": ["我怎么都想起来不他的名字。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这个字我怎么也写不好。", "py": "Zhège zì wǒ zěnme yě xiě bù hǎo.", "en": "However hard I try, I do not manage to write this character well."}, "explain": "Do not put 是 after 怎么也.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["这个", "字", "我", "怎么", "也", "是", "写", "不", "好"], "punct": "。", "spot": 5, "reveal": "这个字我怎么也写不好。", "levelOnly": ["这个字我怎么也是写不好。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "laiqu", "title": "A来A去, A着A着 and 说A就A: again and again, while …, the moment you say so", "cat": "Fixed patterns and sayings", "catOrder": 18, "catBlurb": "Patterns you can fill in and use like a saying: A来A去, 有A有B, 一来…二来…, 看你…的 and X什么X.", "covers": [51, 52, 53], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "A来A去", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "，", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Result", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["A来A去 repeats a verb to show that an action goes on again and again, or back and forth: 他在房间里走来走去 'He walks back and forth in the room'; 我想来想去，还是决定去了 'After thinking it over and over, I still decided to go'. The result or decision follows, often with 还是 or 也.", "A着A着 'while doing A, something happens' shows an action that goes on until a new, often unexpected thing comes in: 他看着看着就睡着了 'He fell asleep while watching'; 我们走着走着，下起雨来了 'We were walking when it began to rain'. The second part needs a new event.", "说A就A 'do A the moment one says so' repeats the verb to show that someone acts at once, with no delay: 他说走就走，没有等我们 'He left the moment he said so, and did not wait for us'; 说干就干，我们现在就开始吧 'Let us get to it right away; let us start now'; 他说哭就哭 'He cries at the drop of a hat'."], "examples": [{"zh": "他在房间里走来走去。", "py": "Tā zài fángjiān lǐ zǒu lái zǒu qù.", "en": "He walks back and forth in the room."}, {"zh": "我想来想去，还是决定去了。", "py": "Wǒ xiǎng lái xiǎng qù, háishi juédìng qù le.", "en": "After thinking it over and over, I still decided to go."}, {"zh": "他看着看着就睡着了。", "py": "Tā kàn zhe kàn zhe jiù shuìzháo le.", "en": "He fell asleep while watching."}, {"zh": "他说走就走，没有等我们。", "py": "Tā shuō zǒu jiù zǒu, méiyǒu děng wǒmen.", "en": "He left the moment he said so, and did not wait for us."}], "mistakes": ["A来A去 uses the same verb twice: 走来走去, 想来想去. Two different verbs do not make this pattern.", "A着A着 needs a second event. 他看着看着 alone sounds unfinished; add 就睡着了 or something similar."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "他在房间里走来走去。", "py": "Tā zài fángjiān lǐ zǒu lái zǒu qù.", "en": "He walks back and forth in the room."}, "explain": "走来走去 = back and forth.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He walks back and forth in the room.", "toks": ["他", "在", "房间", "里", "走", "来", "走", "去"], "reveal": "他在房间里走来走去。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他说哭就哭。", "py": "Tā shuō kū jiù kū.", "en": "He cries at the drop of a hat."}, "explain": "说 + A + 就 + A.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He cries at the drop of a hat.", "toks": ["他", "说", "哭", "就", "哭"], "reveal": "他说哭就哭。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我想来想去，还是决定去了。", "py": "Wǒ xiǎng lái xiǎng qù, háishi juédìng qù le.", "en": "After thinking it over and over, I still decided to go."}, "explain": "还是 brings in the decision after 想来想去.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "我想来想去，___决定去了。", "sub": "After thinking it over and over, I still decided to go.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["haishi", "还是"], "reveal": "还是 · háishi"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他看着看着就睡着了。", "py": "Tā kàn zhe kàn zhe jiù shuìzháo le.", "en": "He fell asleep while watching."}, "explain": "A着A着: 看着看着.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He fell asleep while watching?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他看着看着就睡着了。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他看看着着就睡着了。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他看着看着就睡着了。", "levelOnly": ["他看看着着就睡着了。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他说走就走，没有等我们。", "py": "Tā shuō zǒu jiù zǒu, méiyǒu děng wǒmen.", "en": "He left the moment he said so, and did not wait for us."}, "explain": "就 already means at once; do not add 马上.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "说", "走", "就", "马上", "走", "没有", "等", "我们"], "punct": "。", "spot": 4, "reveal": "他说走就走，没有等我们。", "levelOnly": ["他说走就马上走，没有等我们。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "youa", "title": "有A有B, X也不是Y也不是 and 一来…二来…: both, stuck either way, for one thing", "cat": "Fixed patterns and sayings", "catOrder": 18, "catBlurb": "Patterns you can fill in and use like a saying: A来A去, 有A有B, 一来…二来…, 看你…的 and X什么X.", "covers": [54, 55, 56], "formula": [{"t": "有", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": ""}, {"t": "A", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "有", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "B", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["有A有B 'both A and B' joins two things of the same kind that both exist or both happen. With nouns it shows what there is: 这家饭店有吃有喝，还有音乐 'This restaurant has food and drink, and music too'. With verbs, it shows two actions at the same time: 他们有说有笑地走进了教室 'They walked into the classroom talking and laughing'.", "X也不是，Y也不是 'whichever way, it is not right' describes being stuck in an awkward spot, where neither choice works: 他坐也不是，站也不是，不知道该怎么办 'He does not know whether to sit or stand, and does not know what to do'; 我说也不是，不说也不是，真难办 'I do not know whether to speak or keep quiet; it is really awkward'.", "一来…二来… 'for one thing …, for another …' lists two reasons or two aims in order: 今天我不去了，一来天气不好，二来我有点累 'I am not going today: first, the weather is bad; second, I am a bit tired'; 我想去中国，一来学汉语，二来看朋友 'I want to go to China: first to learn Chinese, second to see my friends'."], "examples": [{"zh": "这家饭店有吃有喝，还有音乐。", "py": "Zhè jiā fàndiàn yǒu chī yǒu hē, hái yǒu yīnyuè.", "en": "This restaurant has food and drink, and music too."}, {"zh": "他们有说有笑地走进了教室。", "py": "Tāmen yǒu shuō yǒu xiào de zǒu jìn le jiàoshì.", "en": "They walked into the classroom talking and laughing."}, {"zh": "他坐也不是，站也不是，不知道该怎么办。", "py": "Tā zuò yě bú shì, zhàn yě bú shì, bù zhīdào gāi zěnmebàn.", "en": "He does not know whether to sit or stand, and does not know what to do."}, {"zh": "今天我不去了，一来天气不好，二来我有点累。", "py": "Jīntiān wǒ bú qù le, yì lái tiānqì bù hǎo, èr lái wǒ yǒu diǎn lèi.", "en": "I am not going today: first, the weather is bad; second, I am a bit tired."}], "mistakes": ["有A有B needs the same kind of word on both sides: 有说有笑 joins two verbs. 有说有好 is wrong.", "一来 and 二来 come as a pair. 一来 with no 二来 sounds unfinished."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "这家饭店有吃有喝。", "py": "Zhè jiā fàndiàn yǒu chī yǒu hē.", "en": "This restaurant has food and drink."}, "explain": "有 + A + 有 + B.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: This restaurant has food and drink.", "toks": ["这", "家", "饭店", "有", "吃", "有", "喝"], "reveal": "这家饭店有吃有喝。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他坐也不是，站也不是。", "py": "Tā zuò yě bú shì, zhàn yě bú shì.", "en": "He does not know whether to sit or stand."}, "explain": "X也不是，Y也不是.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He does not know whether to sit or stand.", "toks": ["他", "坐", "也", "不", "是", "站", "也", "不", "是"], "reveal": "他坐也不是，站也不是。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他坐也不是，站也不是，不知道该怎么办。", "py": "Tā zuò yě bú shì, zhàn yě bú shì, bù zhīdào gāi zěnmebàn.", "en": "He does not know whether to sit or stand, and does not know what to do."}, "explain": "X也不是，Y也不是 pairs two actions that both fail: 坐 and 站.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "他坐也不是，___也不是，不知道该怎么办。", "sub": "He does not know whether to sit or stand, and does not know what to do.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["zhan", "站"], "reveal": "站 · zhàn"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这家饭店有吃有喝，还有音乐。", "py": "Zhè jiā fàndiàn yǒu chī yǒu hē, hái yǒu yīnyuè.", "en": "This restaurant has food and drink, and music too."}, "explain": "有 comes before each part.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: This restaurant has food and drink, and music too?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "这家饭店有吃有喝，还有音乐。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "这家饭店有吃喝有，还有音乐。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "这家饭店有吃有喝，还有音乐。", "levelOnly": ["这家饭店有吃喝有，还有音乐。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他们有说有笑地走进了教室。", "py": "Tāmen yǒu shuō yǒu xiào de zǒu jìn le jiàoshì.", "en": "They walked into the classroom talking and laughing."}, "explain": "The adverb ending is 地, with no 的 before it.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他们", "有", "说", "有", "笑", "的", "地", "走", "进", "了", "教室"], "punct": "。", "spot": 5, "reveal": "他们有说有笑地走进了教室。", "levelOnly": ["他们有说有笑的地走进了教室。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "kan", "title": "看你…的, X什么X and 什么…不…的: look how, why bother, never mind", "cat": "Fixed patterns and sayings", "catOrder": 18, "catBlurb": "Patterns you can fill in and use like a saying: A来A去, 有A有B, 一来…二来…, 看你…的 and X什么X.", "covers": [57, 58, 59], "formula": [{"t": "看你", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Adjective / verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "的", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["看你 + adjective or verb + 的 'look how …' shows how someone's state strikes the speaker, with surprise, pity or teasing: 看你急的 'Look how worried you are!'; 看你累的，快去休息吧 'Look how tired you are; go and rest'. 看你说的 'Come on, what a thing to say' pushes back on what someone said: 看你说的，我怎么会不帮你呢？'Come on, why would I not help you?'", "X什么X 'why bother …, no need to …' repeats a verb or adjective with 什么 in the middle to tell someone to stop: 急什么急？时间还早呢 'Why the hurry? It is still early'; 怕什么怕？有我在呢 'What is there to fear? I am here'. It sounds blunt, so use it with people you know well.", "什么 + A + 不 + A + 的 'never mind (whether) …' waves aside the other person's worry: 什么钱不钱的，我们是朋友 'Never mind money; we are friends'; 什么麻烦不麻烦的，都是小事 'Never mind trouble; it is all small things'. The word in the middle is the thing the other person has just worried about."], "examples": [{"zh": "看你累的，快去休息吧。", "py": "Kàn nǐ lèi de, kuài qù xiūxi ba.", "en": "Look how tired you are; go and rest quickly."}, {"zh": "看你说的，我怎么会不帮你呢？", "py": "Kàn nǐ shuō de, wǒ zěnme huì bù bāng nǐ ne?", "en": "Come on, why would I not help you?"}, {"zh": "急什么急？时间还早呢。", "py": "Jí shénme jí? Shíjiān hái zǎo ne.", "en": "Why the hurry? It is still early."}, {"zh": "什么钱不钱的，我们是朋友！", "py": "Shénme qián bù qián de, wǒmen shì péngyou!", "en": "Never mind money; we are friends!"}], "mistakes": ["X什么X is blunt and can sound rude to a stranger. To be polite, say 别急 or 不要急.", "看你 … 的 needs a state or an action: 看你急的 is right. A plain noun does not fit, so 看你书的 is wrong."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "看你急的！", "py": "Kàn nǐ jí de!", "en": "Look how worried you are!"}, "explain": "看你 + adjective + 的.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Look how worried you are!", "toks": ["看", "你", "急", "的"], "reveal": "看你急的！"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "怕什么怕？有我在呢。", "py": "Pà shénme pà? Yǒu wǒ zài ne.", "en": "What is there to fear? I am here."}, "explain": "怕 + 什么 + 怕.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: What is there to fear? I am here.", "toks": ["怕", "什么", "怕", "有", "我", "在", "呢"], "reveal": "怕什么怕？有我在呢。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "什么钱不钱的，我们是朋友！", "py": "Shénme qián bù qián de, wǒmen shì péngyou!", "en": "Never mind money; we are friends!"}, "explain": "什么 + A + 不 + A + 的.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "___钱不钱的，我们是朋友！", "sub": "Never mind money; we are friends!", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["shenme", "什么"], "reveal": "什么 · shénme"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "急什么急？时间还早呢。", "py": "Jí shénme jí? Shíjiān hái zǎo ne.", "en": "Why the hurry? It is still early."}, "explain": "什么 sits between the two 急.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: Why the hurry? It is still early?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "急什么急？时间还早呢。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "急急什么？时间还早呢。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "急什么急？时间还早呢。", "levelOnly": ["急急什么？时间还早呢。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "看你急的！", "py": "Kàn nǐ jí de!", "en": "Look how worried you are!"}, "explain": "No degree word in 看你 … 的.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["看", "你", "很", "急", "的"], "punct": "！", "spot": 2, "reveal": "看你急的！", "levelOnly": ["看你很急的！"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "bude", "title": "不得了, 极了 and 得很: extremely", "cat": "Describing and comparing", "catOrder": 2, "catBlurb": "Say what something is like, compare things, say how much, and say how well or how completely something is done.", "covers": [60, 61], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Adjective", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "得", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "不得了", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["Adjective or feeling + 得不得了 'extremely, terribly' shows a degree with no limit: 他高兴得不得了 'He is extremely happy'. 不得了 can also stand alone as a comment, 'This is serious!': 这可不得了！ It can be good or bad.", "极了 'extremely' follows an adjective or a feeling at the end of the clause: 这里的风景美极了 'The scenery here is extremely beautiful'. 极了 already carries the degree, so do not add 很 or 非常 before the adjective.", "得很 'very' follows an adjective and is more casual: 他累得很，想早点睡觉 'He is very tired and wants to go to bed early'. In formal writing, 非常 is better. As with 极了, no 很 goes before the adjective."], "examples": [{"zh": "他高兴得不得了。", "py": "Tā gāoxìng de bùdéliǎo.", "en": "He is extremely happy."}, {"zh": "这里的风景美极了。", "py": "Zhèlǐ de fēngjǐng měi jí le.", "en": "The scenery here is extremely beautiful."}, {"zh": "他累得很，想早点睡觉。", "py": "Tā lèi de hěn, xiǎng zǎo diǎn shuìjiào.", "en": "He is very tired and wants to go to bed early."}, {"zh": "这可不得了！", "py": "Zhè kě bùdéliǎo!", "en": "This is serious!"}], "mistakes": ["极了 and 得很 already carry the degree. Do not add 很 or 非常: 很美极了 is wrong; say 美极了.", "得很 is spoken and casual. In an essay or a notice, use 非常 instead."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "这里的风景美极了。", "py": "Zhèlǐ de fēngjǐng měi jí le.", "en": "The scenery here is extremely beautiful."}, "explain": "Adjective + 极了.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: The scenery here is extremely beautiful.", "toks": ["这里", "的", "风景", "美", "极", "了"], "reveal": "这里的风景美极了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他高兴得不得了。", "py": "Tā gāoxìng de bùdéliǎo.", "en": "He is extremely happy."}, "explain": "Adjective + 得不得了.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He is extremely happy.", "toks": ["他", "高兴", "得", "不得了"], "reveal": "他高兴得不得了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他累得很，想早点睡觉。", "py": "Tā lèi de hěn, xiǎng zǎo diǎn shuìjiào.", "en": "He is very tired and wants to go to bed early."}, "explain": "Adjective + 得 + 很 = very.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "他累得___，想早点睡觉。", "sub": "He is very tired and wants to go to bed early.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["hen", "很"], "reveal": "很 · hěn"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他高兴得不得了。", "py": "Tā gāoxìng de bùdéliǎo.", "en": "He is extremely happy."}, "explain": "得 comes right after the adjective.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He is extremely happy?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他高兴得不得了。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他高兴不得了得。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他高兴得不得了。", "levelOnly": ["他高兴不得了得。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这里的风景美极了。", "py": "Zhèlǐ de fēngjǐng měi jí le.", "en": "The scenery here is extremely beautiful."}, "explain": "极了 already means extremely.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["这里", "的", "风景", "很", "美", "极", "了"], "punct": "。", "spot": 3, "reveal": "这里的风景美极了。", "levelOnly": ["这里的风景很美极了。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "zhuangtai", "title": "V得 + clause and 得了 / 不了: so … that, manage to or not", "cat": "Describing and comparing", "catOrder": 2, "catBlurb": "Say what something is like, compare things, say how much, and say how well or how completely something is done.", "covers": [62, 63], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Verb / adjective", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "得", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Result clause", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["得 after a verb or an adjective can bring in a whole clause that shows how far the action or state went: 他高兴得跳了起来 'He was so happy that he jumped up'; 她哭得眼睛都红了 'She cried until her eyes were red'; 他忙得没有时间吃饭 'He was so busy that he had no time to eat'. The result is a full phrase, not a single word.", "得了 and 不了, read liǎo, after a verb tell whether someone can manage the action, mostly about amount or ability. 吃得了 'can finish eating' and 吃不了 'cannot finish eating'. 这么多菜，我们吃得了吗？ 'Will we manage to finish so many dishes?'; 这么多菜，我吃不了 'There is so much food that I will not manage to finish it'; 明天我有事，去不了 'I have something on tomorrow, so I will not make it'. Do not mix it up with 不得了 'extremely'."], "examples": [{"zh": "他高兴得跳了起来。", "py": "Tā gāoxìng de tiào le qǐlái.", "en": "He was so happy that he jumped up."}, {"zh": "她哭得眼睛都红了。", "py": "Tā kū de yǎnjing dōu hóng le.", "en": "She cried until her eyes were red."}, {"zh": "这么多菜，我们吃得了吗？", "py": "Zhème duō cài, wǒmen chī de liǎo ma?", "en": "Will we manage to finish so many dishes?"}, {"zh": "明天我有事，去不了。", "py": "Míngtiān wǒ yǒu shì, qù bù liǎo.", "en": "I have something on tomorrow, so I will not make it."}], "mistakes": ["After 得 + clause, do not add 很 between: 他忙得没有时间吃饭 is right; 他忙得很没有时间 is wrong.", "吃不了 means 'cannot finish', not 'will not eat'. To refuse, say 不吃."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "他高兴得跳了起来。", "py": "Tā gāoxìng de tiào le qǐlái.", "en": "He was so happy that he jumped up."}, "explain": "Verb / adjective + 得 + clause.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He was so happy that he jumped up.", "toks": ["他", "高兴", "得", "跳", "了", "起来"], "reveal": "他高兴得跳了起来。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他忙得没有时间吃饭。", "py": "Tā máng de méiyǒu shíjiān chī fàn.", "en": "He was so busy that he had no time to eat."}, "explain": "忙得 + result.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He was so busy that he had no time to eat.", "toks": ["他", "忙", "得", "没有", "时间", "吃", "饭"], "reveal": "他忙得没有时间吃饭。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这么多菜，我吃不了。", "py": "Zhème duō cài, wǒ chī bù liǎo.", "en": "There is so much food that I will not manage to finish it."}, "explain": "吃不了 = cannot finish.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "这么多菜，我吃___了。", "sub": "There is so much food that I will not manage to finish it.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["bu", "不"], "reveal": "不 · bù"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "她哭得眼睛都红了。", "py": "Tā kū de yǎnjing dōu hóng le.", "en": "She cried until her eyes were red."}, "explain": "得 comes right after the verb.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: She cried until her eyes were red?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "她哭得眼睛都红了。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "她哭眼睛都红了得。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "她哭得眼睛都红了。", "levelOnly": ["她哭眼睛都红了得。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他高兴得跳了起来。", "py": "Tā gāoxìng de tiào le qǐlái.", "en": "He was so happy that he jumped up."}, "explain": "Do not put 很 between 得 and the result.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "高兴", "得", "很", "跳", "了", "起来"], "punct": "。", "spot": 3, "reveal": "他高兴得跳了起来。", "levelOnly": ["他高兴得很跳了起来。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "qilai", "title": "起来, 下去, 下来 and 上: beyond the direction", "cat": "Doing things to things", "catOrder": 1, "catBlurb": "Move things and say what happens to them or whether the action works out: 把, 被 and 听得懂 / 听不懂.", "covers": [64], "formula": [{"t": "Adjective / verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "起来", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["起来 does more than 'rise'. After an adjective it shows a change that begins and keeps growing: 天气热起来了 'The weather is getting hot'. After 看, 吃 or 说 it gives your impression from one angle: 这个菜看起来很好吃 'This dish looks very tasty'; 说起来容易，做起来难 'It is easy to say but hard to do'.", "下去 'keep on' carries an action on from now into the future: 请你说下去 'Please go on talking'; 不管多难，我们都要坚持下去 'However hard it is, we must keep going'.", "下来 'settle down' is for something that quiets, slows or is fixed in place: 请你安静下来 'Please calm down'; 请把电话号码写下来 'Please write the phone number down'. 写下来 is to write something so that it stays; 写下去 is to keep writing.", "上 after a verb shows that someone reaches a goal or starts a state: 他爱上了这座城市 'He fell in love with this city'; 她考上了大学 'She got into university'."], "examples": [{"zh": "天气热起来了。", "py": "Tiānqì rè qǐlái le.", "en": "The weather is getting hot."}, {"zh": "这个菜看起来很好吃。", "py": "Zhège cài kàn qǐlái hěn hǎochī.", "en": "This dish looks very tasty."}, {"zh": "请把电话号码写下来。", "py": "Qǐng bǎ diànhuà hàomǎ xiě xiàlái.", "en": "Please write the phone number down."}, {"zh": "她考上了大学。", "py": "Tā kǎo shàng le dàxué.", "en": "She got into university."}], "mistakes": ["下来 and 下去 are not the same: 写下来 means 'write it down', 写下去 means 'keep writing'.", "看起来, 吃起来 and 说起来 give an impression, and the verb stays right before 起来. The adjective comes after: 看起来很好吃."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "天气热起来了。", "py": "Tiānqì rè qǐlái le.", "en": "The weather is getting hot."}, "explain": "Adjective + 起来 = starts to be.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: The weather is getting hot.", "toks": ["天气", "热", "起来", "了"], "reveal": "天气热起来了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "请把电话号码写下来。", "py": "Qǐng bǎ diànhuà hàomǎ xiě xiàlái.", "en": "Please write the phone number down."}, "explain": "写下来 = write it down.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Please write the phone number down.", "toks": ["请", "把", "电话", "号码", "写", "下来"], "reveal": "请把电话号码写下来。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "请你说下去。", "py": "Qǐng nǐ shuō xiàqù.", "en": "Please go on talking."}, "explain": "下去 = keep on.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "请你说___。", "sub": "Please go on talking.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["xiaqu", "下去"], "reveal": "下去 · xiàqù"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "她考上了大学。", "py": "Tā kǎo shàng le dàxué.", "en": "She got into university."}, "explain": "考上 = pass and get in.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: She got into university?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "她考上了大学。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "她考了上大学。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "她考上了大学。", "levelOnly": ["她考了上大学。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这个菜看起来很好吃。", "py": "Zhège cài kàn qǐlái hěn hǎochī.", "en": "This dish looks very tasty."}, "explain": "Do not put 是 before the adjective.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["这个", "菜", "看", "起来", "是", "很", "好吃"], "punct": "。", "spot": 4, "reveal": "这个菜看起来很好吃。", "levelOnly": ["这个菜看起来是很好吃。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "youzhe", "title": "有着 and 把…当作…: have, treat as", "cat": "Doing things to things", "catOrder": 1, "catBlurb": "Move things and say what happens to them or whether the action works out: 把, 被 and 听得懂 / 听不懂.", "covers": [65, 66], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "有着", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Abstract noun", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["有着 is a formal 有 and goes with an abstract noun such as history, experience, effect or meaning: 这座城市有着很长的历史 'This city has a very long history'; 他有着丰富的经验 'He has rich experience'. 着 is read zhe. For a plain thing, say 有: 我有一本书, not 我有着一本书.", "把 + noun + 当作 / 当成 / 看作 'treat as, regard as' says what someone takes something to be: 他把我当作朋友 'He treats me as a friend'; 我们把他看作自己的老师 'We regard him as our own teacher'. 变成 'turn into' can sit in the same pattern: 他们把这个地方变成了公园 'They turned this place into a park'. Longer forms such as 翻译成 are for a later level."], "examples": [{"zh": "这座城市有着很长的历史。", "py": "Zhè zuò chéngshì yǒuzhe hěn cháng de lìshǐ.", "en": "This city has a very long history."}, {"zh": "他有着丰富的经验。", "py": "Tā yǒuzhe fēngfù de jīngyàn.", "en": "He has rich experience."}, {"zh": "他把我当作朋友。", "py": "Tā bǎ wǒ dàngzuò péngyou.", "en": "He treats me as a friend."}, {"zh": "他们把这个地方变成了公园。", "py": "Tāmen bǎ zhège dìfang biànchéng le gōngyuán.", "en": "They turned this place into a park."}], "mistakes": ["有着 is for abstract things. 我有着一本书 is wrong; say 我有一本书.", "In 把 … 当作 …, the thing that is treated comes right after 把. If you switch the two nouns, the meaning changes: 他把我当作朋友 and 他把朋友当作我 are not the same."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "他有着丰富的经验。", "py": "Tā yǒuzhe fēngfù de jīngyàn.", "en": "He has rich experience."}, "explain": "有着 + abstract noun.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He has rich experience.", "toks": ["他", "有着", "丰富", "的", "经验"], "reveal": "他有着丰富的经验。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他把我当作朋友。", "py": "Tā bǎ wǒ dàngzuò péngyou.", "en": "He treats me as a friend."}, "explain": "把 + noun + 当作 + noun.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He treats me as a friend.", "toks": ["他", "把", "我", "当作", "朋友"], "reveal": "他把我当作朋友。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这座城市有着很长的历史。", "py": "Zhè zuò chéngshì yǒuzhe hěn cháng de lìshǐ.", "en": "This city has a very long history."}, "explain": "有着 goes with an abstract noun such as 历史.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "这座城市有着很长的___。", "sub": "This city has a very long history.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["lishi", "历史"], "reveal": "历史 · lìshǐ"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他们把这个地方变成了公园。", "py": "Tāmen bǎ zhège dìfang biànchéng le gōngyuán.", "en": "They turned this place into a park."}, "explain": "把 + thing + 变成 + result.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: They turned this place into a park?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他们把这个地方变成了公园。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他们把变成了这个地方公园。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他们把这个地方变成了公园。", "levelOnly": ["他们把变成了这个地方公园。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他有着丰富的经验。", "py": "Tā yǒuzhe fēngfù de jīngyàn.", "en": "He has rich experience."}, "explain": "Do not put 是 after 有着.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "有着", "是", "丰富", "的", "经验"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "他有着丰富的经验。", "levelOnly": ["他有着是丰富的经验。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "notional", "title": "饭做好了 and 来了一位新同学: no 被, arrivals and losses", "cat": "Doing things to things", "catOrder": 1, "catBlurb": "Move things and say what happens to them or whether the action works out: 把, 被 and 听得懂 / 听不懂.", "covers": [67, 68], "formula": [{"t": "Thing", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Verb + result", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "了", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["Chinese does not need 被 when it is clear that the thing receives the action. 饭做好了 'The meal has been cooked'; 衣服洗干净了 'The clothes have been washed clean'; 问题解决了 'The problem has been solved'. The thing comes first, a verb with a result follows (好, 干净, 完), and nobody is named because it does not matter or is already clear.", "For arrivals and losses, a new thing comes after the verb: 我们班来了一位新同学 'A new classmate has joined our class'; 前面来了一辆车 'A car has come from ahead'. The place or group comes first, then 来了 or 丢了, then the thing, usually with a number and a measure word. A thing the listener already knows comes before the verb: 我的手机丢了 'My phone is lost'."], "examples": [{"zh": "饭做好了。", "py": "Fàn zuò hǎo le.", "en": "The meal has been cooked."}, {"zh": "问题解决了。", "py": "Wèntí jiějué le.", "en": "The problem has been solved."}, {"zh": "我们班来了一位新同学。", "py": "Wǒmen bān lái le yí wèi xīn tóngxué.", "en": "A new classmate has joined our class."}, {"zh": "我的手机丢了。", "py": "Wǒ de shǒujī diū le.", "en": "My phone is lost."}], "mistakes": ["Do not add 被 when the meaning is already clear. 饭做好了 is natural; 饭被做好了 sounds odd, as if someone suffered. 被 is for something that happened to someone, or when you name the doer.", "In 我们班来了一位新同学, the place comes first. 来了一位新同学我们班 is wrong."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "饭做好了。", "py": "Fàn zuò hǎo le.", "en": "The meal has been cooked."}, "explain": "Thing + verb + result + 了.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: The meal has been cooked.", "toks": ["饭", "做", "好", "了"], "reveal": "饭做好了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我们班来了一位新同学。", "py": "Wǒmen bān lái le yí wèi xīn tóngxué.", "en": "A new classmate has joined our class."}, "explain": "Place + 来了 + new person.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: A new classmate has joined our class.", "toks": ["我们", "班", "来", "了", "一", "位", "新", "同学"], "reveal": "我们班来了一位新同学。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "问题解决了。", "py": "Wèntí jiějué le.", "en": "The problem has been solved."}, "explain": "The thing comes first; no 被 is needed.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "问题___了。", "sub": "The problem has been solved.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["jiejue", "解决"], "reveal": "解决 · jiějué"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我的手机丢了。", "py": "Wǒ de shǒujī diū le.", "en": "My phone is lost."}, "explain": "A known thing comes before 丢了.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: My phone is lost?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "我的手机丢了。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "我的丢了手机。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "我的手机丢了。", "levelOnly": ["我的丢了手机。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "饭做好了。", "py": "Fàn zuò hǎo le.", "en": "The meal has been cooked."}, "explain": "No 被 is needed when the meaning is already clear.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["饭", "被", "做", "好", "了"], "punct": "。", "spot": 1, "reveal": "饭做好了。", "levelOnly": ["饭被做好了。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "adverbials", "title": "Time, place, manner and serial verbs: word order before the verb", "cat": "Building a sentence", "catOrder": 0, "catBlurb": "The skeleton of a sentence: who does what, 是, 有, 的 and pronouns.", "covers": [69, 70], "formula": [{"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Time", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Place", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Manner", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Verb", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["Time, place and manner words all go before the verb, in this order: who, when, where, how, what. 我们明天下午在学校门口见面 'We will meet at the school gate tomorrow afternoon'; 他每天早上在公园里认真地跑步 'Every morning he runs seriously in the park'. A manner word ending in 地 sits right before the verb: 孩子们在院子里高兴地玩 'The children play happily in the yard'.", "Serial verbs put two or more verbs one after another, in the order they happen, with one subject and nothing between them. 我去商店买东西 'I go to the shop to buy things'; 他坐飞机去上海 'He goes to Shanghai by plane'; 他打开门走了出去 'He opened the door and walked out'. The first verb often shows the way or the means, and the last shows the aim. 了 goes after the verb that ends the chain."], "examples": [{"zh": "我们明天下午在学校门口见面。", "py": "Wǒmen míngtiān xiàwǔ zài xuéxiào ménkǒu jiànmiàn.", "en": "We will meet at the school gate tomorrow afternoon."}, {"zh": "他每天早上在公园里认真地跑步。", "py": "Tā měitiān zǎoshang zài gōngyuán lǐ rènzhēn de pǎobù.", "en": "Every morning he runs seriously in the park."}, {"zh": "我去商店买东西。", "py": "Wǒ qù shāngdiàn mǎi dōngxi.", "en": "I go to the shop to buy things."}, {"zh": "他坐飞机去上海。", "py": "Tā zuò fēijī qù Shànghǎi.", "en": "He goes to Shanghai by plane."}], "mistakes": ["The place goes before the verb in Chinese: 我在公园里跑步, not 我跑步在公园里.", "Do not join serial verbs with 和: 我去商店买东西, not 我去商店和买东西."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "我们明天在学校门口见面。", "py": "Wǒmen míngtiān zài xuéxiào ménkǒu jiànmiàn.", "en": "We will meet at the school gate tomorrow."}, "explain": "Time, then place, then verb.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: We will meet at the school gate tomorrow.", "toks": ["我们", "明天", "在", "学校", "门口", "见面"], "reveal": "我们明天在学校门口见面。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他坐飞机去上海。", "py": "Tā zuò fēijī qù Shànghǎi.", "en": "He goes to Shanghai by plane."}, "explain": "Means first, then the aim.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He goes to Shanghai by plane.", "toks": ["他", "坐", "飞机", "去", "上海"], "reveal": "他坐飞机去上海。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "孩子们在院子里高兴地玩。", "py": "Háizimen zài yuànzi lǐ gāoxìng de wán.", "en": "The children play happily in the yard."}, "explain": "Manner + 地 + verb.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "孩子们在院子里高兴___玩。", "sub": "The children play happily in the yard.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["de", "地"], "reveal": "地 · de"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我去商店买东西。", "py": "Wǒ qù shāngdiàn mǎi dōngxi.", "en": "I go to the shop to buy things."}, "explain": "Verbs follow the order of the actions.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: I go to the shop to buy things?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "我去商店买东西。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "我买东西去商店。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "我去商店买东西。", "levelOnly": ["我买东西去商店。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我去商店买东西。", "py": "Wǒ qù shāngdiàn mǎi dōngxi.", "en": "I go to the shop to buy things."}, "explain": "Serial verbs have no 和 between them.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["我", "去", "商店", "和", "买", "东西"], "punct": "。", "spot": 3, "reveal": "我去商店买东西。", "levelOnly": ["我去商店和买东西。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "xiangbi", "title": "跟…相比 and 比 + amount: compared with, three years older", "cat": "Describing and comparing", "catOrder": 2, "catBlurb": "Say what something is like, compare things, say how much, and say how well or how completely something is done.", "covers": [71, 72], "formula": [{"t": "跟", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": ""}, {"t": "Standard", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "相比", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "，", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Subject", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Difference", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["跟 … 相比 'compared with …' puts the thing you compare against first, then says how the main subject differs: 跟去年相比，今年的雨多了 'Compared with last year, there is more rain this year'; 跟他相比，我的汉语差多了 'Compared with him, my Chinese is much worse'. 与 and 和 can replace 跟; 与 is the most formal.", "In a 比 sentence, the amount goes after the adjective to say by how much: 他比我大三岁 'He is three years older than me'; 这本书比那本贵很多 'This book is much more expensive than that one'; 我比他高一点儿 'I am a bit taller than him'; 这条路比那条长五公里 'This road is five kilometres longer than that one'. Do not put 很 before the adjective in a 比 sentence."], "examples": [{"zh": "跟去年相比，今年的雨多了。", "py": "Gēn qùnián xiāngbǐ, jīnnián de yǔ duō le.", "en": "Compared with last year, there is more rain this year."}, {"zh": "跟他相比，我的汉语差多了。", "py": "Gēn tā xiāngbǐ, wǒ de Hànyǔ chà duō le.", "en": "Compared with him, my Chinese is much worse."}, {"zh": "他比我大三岁。", "py": "Tā bǐ wǒ dà sān suì.", "en": "He is three years older than me."}, {"zh": "这本书比那本贵很多。", "py": "Zhè běn shū bǐ nà běn guì hěn duō.", "en": "This book is much more expensive than that one."}], "mistakes": ["相比 needs 跟, 与 or 和 before the thing compared: 跟去年相比 is right; 去年相比 is wrong.", "Do not put 很 before the adjective in a 比 sentence: 他比我很大 is wrong. Put the amount after it: 他比我大三岁."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "他比我大三岁。", "py": "Tā bǐ wǒ dà sān suì.", "en": "He is three years older than me."}, "explain": "比 + person + adjective + amount.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He is three years older than me.", "toks": ["他", "比", "我", "大", "三", "岁"], "reveal": "他比我大三岁。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "跟去年相比，雨多了。", "py": "Gēn qùnián xiāngbǐ, yǔ duō le.", "en": "Compared with last year, there is more rain."}, "explain": "跟 + standard + 相比.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Compared with last year, there is more rain.", "toks": ["跟", "去年", "相比", "雨", "多", "了"], "reveal": "跟去年相比，雨多了。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "跟去年相比，今年的雨多了。", "py": "Gēn qùnián xiāngbǐ, jīnnián de yǔ duō le.", "en": "Compared with last year, there is more rain this year."}, "explain": "跟 … 相比 = compared with ….", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "跟去年___，今年的雨多了。", "sub": "Compared with last year, there is more rain this year.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["xiangbi", "相比"], "reveal": "相比 · xiāngbǐ"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这本书比那本贵很多。", "py": "Zhè běn shū bǐ nà běn guì hěn duō.", "en": "This book is much more expensive than that one."}, "explain": "The amount goes after the adjective.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: This book is much more expensive than that one?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "这本书比那本贵很多。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "这本书比那本很贵多。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "这本书比那本贵很多。", "levelOnly": ["这本书比那本很贵多。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他比我大三岁。", "py": "Tā bǐ wǒ dà sān suì.", "en": "He is three years older than me."}, "explain": "No 很 in a 比 sentence.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["他", "比", "我", "很", "大", "三", "岁"], "punct": "。", "spot": 3, "reveal": "他比我大三岁。", "levelOnly": ["他比我很大三岁。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "mw5", "title": "朵, 幅, 颗, 匹, 扇, 册 and 届: new measure words", "cat": "Numbers and counting", "catOrder": 6, "catBlurb": "Measure words, numbers, money, age, halves, rough numbers, and how much or how many.", "covers": [73], "formula": [{"t": "Number", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "朵 / 幅 / 颗 / 匹 / 扇", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}, {"t": "Noun", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["Each noun has its own measure word, so learn the pair together. 朵 is for flowers and clouds: 一朵花 'a flower'. 幅 is for paintings, pictures and cloth: 一幅画 'a painting'. 颗 is for small round things such as stars, hearts and sweets: 一颗星星 'a star'. 匹 is for horses: 一匹马 'a horse'. 扇 is for doors and windows: 一扇门 'a door'.", "册 is for volumes and copies of books: 第二册课本 'the second volume of the textbook'. 届 is for sessions, such as a competition, a meeting or a graduating class, and goes with 第 and a number: 第三届运动会 'the third sports meeting'. The sentence 墙上挂着一幅画 'A painting hangs on the wall' shows the usual order: place, verb, number, measure word, noun."], "examples": [{"zh": "桌子上有一朵花。", "py": "Zhuōzi shàng yǒu yì duǒ huā.", "en": "There is a flower on the table."}, {"zh": "墙上挂着一幅画。", "py": "Qiáng shàng guà zhe yì fú huà.", "en": "A painting hangs on the wall."}, {"zh": "他骑着一匹马。", "py": "Tā qí zhe yì pǐ mǎ.", "en": "He is riding a horse."}, {"zh": "那扇门是开着的。", "py": "Nà shān mén shì kāi zhe de.", "en": "That door is open."}], "mistakes": ["Measure words are not interchangeable: a door is 一扇门, not 一朵门. Learn each noun with its measure word.", "届 is only for sessions and classes (第三届), not for ordinary times: say 三次, not 三届, for 'three times'."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "桌子上有一朵花。", "py": "Zhuōzi shàng yǒu yì duǒ huā.", "en": "There is a flower on the table."}, "explain": "一朵花 = a flower.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: There is a flower on the table.", "toks": ["桌子", "上", "有", "一", "朵", "花"], "reveal": "桌子上有一朵花。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "天上有很多颗星星。", "py": "Tiānshàng yǒu hěn duō kē xīngxing.", "en": "There are many stars in the sky."}, "explain": "颗 goes with 星星.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: There are many stars in the sky.", "toks": ["天上", "有", "很", "多", "颗", "星星"], "reveal": "天上有很多颗星星。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "墙上挂着一幅画。", "py": "Qiáng shàng guà zhe yì fú huà.", "en": "A painting hangs on the wall."}, "explain": "幅 is the measure word for 画.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "墙上挂着一___画。", "sub": "A painting hangs on the wall.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["fu", "幅"], "reveal": "幅 · fú"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他骑着一匹马。", "py": "Tā qí zhe yì pǐ mǎ.", "en": "He is riding a horse."}, "explain": "匹 is the measure word for horses.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He is riding a horse?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他骑着一匹马。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他骑着一扇马。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他骑着一匹马。", "levelOnly": ["他骑着一扇马。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我们学校的第三届运动会开始了。", "py": "Wǒmen xuéxiào de dì sān jiè yùndònghuì kāishǐ le.", "en": "The third sports meeting of our school has started."}, "explain": "届 is already the measure word; do not add 个.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["我们", "学校", "的", "第", "三", "届", "个", "运动会", "开始", "了"], "punct": "。", "spot": 6, "reveal": "我们学校的第三届运动会开始了。", "levelOnly": ["我们学校的第三届个运动会开始了。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "xing", "title": "性, 本, 之一 and 是否: -ness, this, one of, whether", "cat": "Formal and written style", "catOrder": 17, "catBlurb": "Written and formal ways to say things you already know in speech: 将, 由, 所, 令, 彼此 and 如此.", "covers": [74, 75, 76, 77], "formula": [{"t": "Adjective / noun", "k": false, "z": false, "sep": ""}, {"t": "性", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": "+"}], "explain": ["性 after an adjective or a noun makes an abstract noun, like '-ness' or '-ity': 重要性 'importance', 安全性 'safety', 积极性 'enthusiasm', 可能性 'possibility'. 这件事的重要性不用多说 'The importance of this matter needs no more words'; 这个办法的可能性很小 'The chance of this method working is very small'.", "本 'this, our' before a noun is formal and points to the speaker's own group or the current time: 欢迎来到本公司 'Welcome to our company'; 本月我们很忙 'This month we are very busy'.", "之一 'one of' follows the group: 上海是中国最大的城市之一 'Shanghai is one of China's biggest cities'; 他是我最好的朋友之一 'He is one of my best friends'. The group before 之一 often has 最 or a number.", "是否 'whether or not' is the formal form of 是不是 or 有没有 in an indirect question: 我不知道他是否同意 'I do not know whether he agrees'; 请告诉我你是否有空 'Please tell me whether you are free'. Do not add 吗 after it."], "examples": [{"zh": "这件事的重要性不用多说。", "py": "Zhè jiàn shì de zhòngyàoxìng búyòng duō shuō.", "en": "The importance of this matter needs no more words."}, {"zh": "欢迎来到本公司。", "py": "Huānyíng lái dào běn gōngsī.", "en": "Welcome to our company."}, {"zh": "他是我最好的朋友之一。", "py": "Tā shì wǒ zuìhǎo de péngyou zhīyī.", "en": "He is one of my best friends."}, {"zh": "我不知道他是否同意。", "py": "Wǒ bù zhīdào tā shìfǒu tóngyì.", "en": "I do not know whether he agrees."}], "mistakes": ["是否 already asks the question, so do not add 吗: 我不知道他是否同意 is right; 我不知道他是否同意吗 is wrong.", "之一 comes after the whole group. Say 上海是中国最大的城市之一, not 上海是之一中国最大的城市."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "他是我最好的朋友之一。", "py": "Tā shì wǒ zuìhǎo de péngyou zhīyī.", "en": "He is one of my best friends."}, "explain": "Group + 之一.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He is one of my best friends.", "toks": ["他", "是", "我", "最好", "的", "朋友", "之一"], "reveal": "他是我最好的朋友之一。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "欢迎来到本公司。", "py": "Huānyíng lái dào běn gōngsī.", "en": "Welcome to our company."}, "explain": "本 + noun = our.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: Welcome to our company.", "toks": ["欢迎", "来", "到", "本", "公司"], "reveal": "欢迎来到本公司。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这个办法的可能性很小。", "py": "Zhège bànfǎ de kěnéngxìng hěn xiǎo.", "en": "The chance of this method working is very small."}, "explain": "可能 + 性 = possibility.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "这个办法的___很小。", "sub": "The chance of this method working is very small.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["kenengxing", "可能性"], "reveal": "可能性 · kěnéngxìng"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我不知道他是否同意。", "py": "Wǒ bù zhīdào tā shìfǒu tóngyì.", "en": "I do not know whether he agrees."}, "explain": "是否 goes before the verb.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: I do not know whether he agrees?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "我不知道他是否同意。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "我不知道他同意是否。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "我不知道他是否同意。", "levelOnly": ["我不知道他同意是否。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "请告诉我你是否有空。", "py": "Qǐng gàosu wǒ nǐ shìfǒu yǒukòng.", "en": "Please tell me whether you are free."}, "explain": "是否 already asks the question; do not add 吗.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["请", "告诉", "我", "你", "是否", "有空", "吗"], "punct": "。", "spot": 6, "reveal": "请告诉我你是否有空。", "levelOnly": ["请告诉我你是否有空吗。"]}], "qx": []},
{"id": "newmean5", "title": "Words you know, with a new meaning", "cat": "Words with more than one job", "catOrder": 14, "catBlurb": "Words you know that do another job or have another sound: 只 (zhī, zhǐ), 什么 and 谁 meaning \"any\", and 得, 地, 还, 会 and 长.", "covers": [78], "formula": [{"t": "看家 kān", "k": true, "z": true, "sep": ""}], "explain": ["Some words you already know come back in HSK 5 with another meaning or another sound. The character is the same; the words around it tell you which one it is.", "A new sound. 看 kān means 'to look after, to guard': 看家 'guard the house', 看门 'keep the door'; 看 kàn is 'to look'. 当 dàng means 'to treat as': 当作 'treat as', 上当 'be fooled'; 当 dāng is 'when, to be'. 倒 dǎo means 'to fall over': 摔倒 'fall down'; 倒 dào is 'to pour' or 'backwards'. 数 shǔ means 'to count': 数数 'count'; 数 shù is 'a number': 数字. 背 bèi means 'the back' and 'to recite': 背书 'recite a lesson', 背后 'behind'; 背 bēi is 'to carry on the back': 背书包. 好 hào means 'to like': 爱好 'hobby', 好奇 'curious'; 好 hǎo is 'good'. 行 háng means 'a row, a line of work': 行业 'industry', 银行 'bank'; 行 xíng is 'OK'. 量 liàng means 'amount': 数量 'quantity'; 量 liáng is 'to measure'. 为 wéi means 'to be, as': 成为 'become', 作为 'as'; 为 wèi is 'for'. 头 is neutral, tou, as a suffix: 木头 'wood', 石头 'stone', 里头 'inside'; on its own, 头 tóu is 'head'.", "The same sound, a new meaning. 才 cái also means 'talent': 人才 'talented person', 天才 'genius'. 本 běn means 'this, one's own': 本月 'this month', 本地 'local'. 别 bié also means 'to part': 告别 'say goodbye', 分别 'part'. 喂 wèi means 'to feed': 喂鱼 'feed the fish'. 省 shěng means 'to save': 省钱 'save money'. 面 miàn means 'surface, side': 水面 'the water surface', 方面 'aspect'.", "Five more come in pairs. 称 is chēng 'to weigh, to call' and chèn 'to match': 对称 'symmetrical'. 处 is chǔ 'to be in, to deal with' and chù 'a place, a point': 好处 'benefit', 到处 'everywhere'. 调 is diào 'to transfer, to investigate' and tiáo 'to adjust': 空调 'air conditioner'. 系 is jì 'to fasten' and xì 'a system, a department': 中文系 'the Chinese department'. 批 is pī 'a batch' and 'to approve'."], "examples": [{"zh": "我们家的狗会看家。", "py": "Wǒmen jiā de gǒu huì kānjiā.", "en": "Our dog can guard the house."}, {"zh": "请你数数这里有几本书。", "py": "Qǐng nǐ shǔshu zhèlǐ yǒu jǐ běn shū.", "en": "Please count how many books there are here."}, {"zh": "你要小心，别上当。", "py": "Nǐ yào xiǎoxīn, bié shàngdàng.", "en": "You must be careful; do not be fooled."}, {"zh": "他摔倒了。", "py": "Tā shuāidǎo le.", "en": "He fell down."}], "mistakes": ["The sound is decided by the words around it: 看家 is kān but 看书 is kàn; 摔倒 is dǎo but 倒水 is dào; 数数 is shǔ but 数字 is shù.", "头 after 木, 石 or 里 is neutral: 木头 mùtou. On its own, or in 头发, it is tóu, 'head'."], "q": [{"sentence": {"zh": "他每天早上在教室里背书。", "py": "Tā měitiān zǎoshang zài jiàoshì lǐ bèishū.", "en": "He recites his lessons in the classroom every morning."}, "explain": "背 bèi = to recite.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: He recites his lessons in the classroom every morning.", "toks": ["他", "每天", "早上", "在", "教室", "里", "背书"], "reveal": "他每天早上在教室里背书。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "我想省一点钱。", "py": "Wǒ xiǎng shěng yì diǎn qián.", "en": "I want to save a little money."}, "explain": "省 shěng = to save.", "type": "order", "kicker": "Build it", "prompt": "Put the words in order: I want to save a little money.", "toks": ["我", "想", "省", "一", "点", "钱"], "reveal": "我想省一点钱。"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "孩子们对什么都很好奇。", "py": "Háizimen duì shénme dōu hěn hàoqí.", "en": "Children are curious about everything."}, "explain": "好 hào = to like; 好奇 = curious.", "type": "cloze", "kicker": "Fill it", "prompt": "Type the missing word", "big": "孩子们对什么都很___。", "sub": "Children are curious about everything.", "placeholder": "Pinyin or character", "accepts": ["haoqi", "好奇"], "reveal": "好奇 · hàoqí"}, {"sentence": {"zh": "他每天晚上喂鱼。", "py": "Tā měitiān wǎnshang wèi yú.", "en": "He feeds the fish every evening."}, "explain": "喂 wèi = to feed.", "type": "mc", "kicker": "Choose", "prompt": "Which sentence says: He feeds the fish every evening?", "options": [{"id": "a", "label": "他每天晚上喂鱼。"}, {"id": "b", "label": "他每天晚上鱼喂。"}], "correct": "a", "reveal": "他每天晚上喂鱼。", "levelOnly": ["他每天晚上鱼喂。"]}, {"sentence": {"zh": "这个行业很辛苦。", "py": "Zhège hángyè hěn xīnkǔ.", "en": "This line of work is very hard."}, "explain": "Do not put 是 before an adjective.", "type": "spot", "kicker": "Spot the mistake", "prompt": "Tap the word that does not belong", "tokens": ["这个", "行业", "是", "很", "辛苦"], "punct": "。", "spot": 2, "reveal": "这个行业很辛苦。", "levelOnly": ["这个行业是很辛苦。"]}], "qx": []}
